    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ikogisi warm Spring na one jolifikashon ples wey dey one town for Ekiti Stet, wey stand gidigba for Sautwest inside Obodo Naijá.E get one Kold spring wey stil dey totori muv togeda as di wom spring sef dey to jolifiket dey muv o, na im dem join bodi for di point wey dem de kol Konfluens. Wey bi sey di two of dem get there hot wota propati-dem. Na dis one kon mek di Ikogosi warm spring where pipul go kon dey jolli jolli for Naijá. Pipul wey dey chuke hand for different mata kon find out sey di wom spring hot wota temperazho bi like 70°C from di ples wey e tek de kom from an bi like 37°C for di ples wey e tek join bodi wit kold wota spring (Confluence). Dis ples na di ogbonge historical siti for Naijá for kontri pipul wey enjoi to dey swim wel wel" },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "For ples wey malaria dey too kach pipul Wold Helti Organisashion (WHO) tok sey pesin wey get fifa or wey e bodi dey hot pass 37.5°C fit get malaria.Smol pikin wey e hand dey yelo or test wey dey du for lab wey sho sey haemoglobin levu don go down pass 8 gram per deciliter of bulod fit sho dey di pikin get malaria." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Isaac Boro Park na dey public park and outdoor recreation area located along the Old GRA neighborhood of Rivers State capital, Port Harcourt. na dey park is named after Isaac Boro, who was one of the pioneers of minority rights activism in Nigeria. The geographical coordinates of the park are: 4°47'16\"N (4.787960), 7°0'19\"E (7.005517)." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "na dey geographic coordinates are 7°27′36″N 5°25′12″E / 7.46000°N 5.42000°E / 7.46000; 5.42000. Ise ekiti is divided into three quarters namely; Oraye, Odo Ise and Erinwa. The Arinjale of Ise-Ekiti is Oba Ayodele Ajayi Aweloye II. ." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Makwa (also spelled Makwia) na dey town in Sokoto State, Nigeria. Na dey located at approximately 13°20′39″N 04°15′30″E / 13.34417°N 4.25833°E / 13.34417; 4.25833, and has a population of roughly 3,000." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Uranus bi di sevunt planet from di Sun. E bi a gaseous cyan-kolourd ice jaiant. Mos of di planet bi wota, ammonia, and methaen for a supakritikal faez of mata, wey for astronomi bi 'ice' or volatais. Di planet atmosfe get komplex layerd klaud strochor and get di lowes minimum temperashor of 49 K (−224 °C; −371 °F) aut of aul di Sola System planet-dem. E get a makd axial tilt of 82.23° wit a retrograed rotashon period of 17 hauas and 14 minuts. Dis mean say for an 84-Earth-year obital period araund di Sun, e pol-dem get araund 42 years of kontinuous sunlait, wey dey folod bai 42 years of kontinuous daknes. E get di simbol and ." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Di tempireshon of Mokwa town dey kom an go dorin a hol year. Di tempireshon na bitwin 63°F to 98°F. Di tempireshon fit go down to 57°F an e fit go up to 103°F" },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Dorin dia hot sisin wey dey hapun from February 3 to April 26, di tempireshon dey pass 95°F." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Innocent Ujah Idibia (dem bon am for 18 September 1975), wey pipul no wel wel as 2baba, na Naija singa, song-raita an podusa an im sabi dash pipul moni an gift wel wel." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Bifor July 2014 na 2face Idibia bi di nem wey im dey yuz for stej." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Alexander Abolore Adegbola Akande (dem bon am for January 17, 1980) wey pipul sabi wel wel as 9ice na Naija singa, dansa an pesin wey dey rait song. Pipul sabi am wel wel as e dey yuz Yoruba langwej tek sing wel an as e stil dey yuz provab tek sing wel." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Asa Alonso Allen (dem bon am for March 27, 1910 an e kpai for June 11, 1970) wey pipul sabi am wela as A.A Allen bi Amerika Pentecostal pastor wey dey tek faith hil an diliva pipul." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Abass Akande Obesere (wey dem bon for 20 January 1965) wey pipul dey kol \"Omo Rapala\" na Naija Muzishan, singa an rekod produsa wey kom fom Ibadan, wey bi big ples for Naija. Obesere na pesin wey pipul no wel wel for im wok wey bi to dey sing fuji song. Meni pipul laik im wok bikos di kain mentod wey e dey yuz arenj im song dey mek pipul for maket, strit, vilej an garaj laik dem. E dey folo di Sikiru Ayinde Barrister ezampul wey pipul sabi wel wel for Naijá an for di wold, Obesere don kari im muzik go difren difren kontri sef. Sony Music giv am kontrat bot im komot wen dey no gree ontop moni mata, Obesere kon go du kontrat for anoda ples, Obesere an K1 D ultimate wey dey sing fuji muzik sef no dey gree for diasef." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Alhaji Obesere moto wey bi Lexus jeep Lx470 get asident for Ijebu wen im dey kom Lagos. Di asident hapun for Sunday April 8 2012, di taim wey di tin hapun na 7:30pm. Pipul wey dey tok niuz tok sey Obesere an two oda pesin dey for di moto wen di tin hapun an no bi sey dem dai as dey kari dem go hospitu for Orisunbare Hospital, Jakande Isolo, Lagos. Na wund di two pesin get for di moto." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Abayomi Adebayo Barber (dem bon am October 23, 1928 an e dai for December 26, 2021) na Naija pesin wey dey draw fain fain tins for Naijá an e bi di oga for Barber Art School wey dey insaid Legos for Naija. E get koneshion wel wel for insaid Naijá muzik but plenti oyibo pipul no sabi am. Dem rili sabi am as pesin wey biliv sey evritin wey dey hapun for dis laif jost dey hapun an dem sabi am as pesin wey biliv sey dream dey hapun.Barber don rait som tins abaut di foma presido for Naija wey di nem na Murtala Mohammed an anoda pesin wey don bi Oba for Ile-Ife bifor wey im nem na Adesoji Aderemi. One of e wok wey pipul sabi wel wel na di one wey im yuz oil pent tek draw Shehu Shagari." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Na for 1989 Barber fest sho plenti pipul im wok an e kol am Abayomi Barber A Retrospective. Som of im wok stil dey for insaid National Gallery of Modern Art laik di one wey im yuz stone design Ali Maigoro an Yemoja." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Abraka na house for University of Delta state Abraka. For 1992 dem establish Dealt state university and di main campus dey for town of Abraka and di oder campus dey Anwai Asaba. For 1995 di university make small amendment wey make dem bring out anoder campus for Oleh. Di university dey run Multi-campus system with three campuses wey get distance of about 200km apart. Currently di university get students of about 36000 (for 2007/08 session) di university dey do different programmes from di full certificate, diploma, and weekend degree programmes." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Adejumoke bikom popula for di lidin rol wey e plai as Esther(small but mighty) inside di TV siris wey e nem na Jenifa's Diary for 2016.Adejumoke don akt ova 10 fim an e fit akt Yoruba an Inglish fim. Shi work as an on-air personality at Goldmyne Entertainment as a Presenta for Box Office TV sho onda Daniel Ademinokan In 2010/2011. shi Work for Concert Radio (an online Radio station in Nigeria) fom 2012 go rish 2015, den shi kon go produs di fest sisin of ha TV sho wey e nem \"The Lounge with Jumoke\", an entatainmet sho wey selibriti dey du intaviu and fashion tok for 2012." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Di produshon of Badamasi stat for 2017 di Fim tori na old one na since 1980/1990s naija an dem shot di fim for Lagos,Minna,Abuja an University of Nigeria (UNN)Msukka. Di fim daireto tel pulse Nigeria for intaview sey e tel am 4 yeaz" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Shalom bi di winna of di Next movie star Realiti show for 2015/2016 shi mek ha aktin debut for monalisa chinda's Talk show taitu Yu an I wit monalisa. Shi tel The punch dat rijecshon na wan of di tin wéy shi déy fight wit as shi stat for Nollywood fim. For 2016 shi akt ha fest fim wéy di taitu na An Hour wit The shrink wit Annie Macaulay ldibia, Gbenro Ajibade, an segun Arinze. Shalom akt wit Desmond Elliot for The Damned an lrokoTv fim. For 2018 shalom stat ha own fim producshon kompani,Cynthia shalom producshon. Ha rol fo one of ha movie taitu chain wéy feature Eddie Watson, Enado odigie, Emem Ufot wéy giv ha tu individual nominashon, Best Aktres For leadin rol an most promisin Aktres fo di 2019 Best of Nollywood Awards." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Emem popula wel wel as model wen e win di 2011/2012 Kalabar Karnival on December 23, 2011. Na First Bank of Nigeria dash dem moni to du di Karnival. Emem bi di ambassado an ofisiali tok tok pesin for pikin wey dia mama trowey for di sem year e win quin of Kalabar karnival.(na foma waif of Gofnor of Kross Riva stet Obioma Liyel-Imoke fom di Organisashion). Emem don akt in plenti fims." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Dem bon am 11 November 1991. Biis oda AF Ca sho for 2014. Lilian win as one of di rihaliti star dat year. Lilian dey di 2015 fim \"Road to yesterday\", e dey one short fim wey di tahitu na \"pepper soup\". E dey di Mnet TV series \"Do good\" as Venice di blogga 2015/2016.Lilian folo mek di muvi \"Dark past\". Shi Stat entatainment kompani EEP entatainment. Lilian fest fim as a podusa na Bound an selebriti wey akt inside na Rita Dominic, Enyinna Nwigwe, Joyce Kalu an prince Nwafor." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Olanrewaju Ajibola plai for Naijá for di nomba 39 Chess Olympiad, e score 4/9 on board 2 fo dat game." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "(1951/52 - 3 March 2021) im bi Naija aktor and broadcaster bifore i die. In 2015, im win Africa Movie Academy Aword For Best Actor for his role as \"inspector Waziri\" in October." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Afta di Congo pipul don fight demself finish for October 1997 wey dem komot Lissouba an Sassou Nguesso kom begin rul again, Abibi komot hand for politis mata for Congo for meni years. E kom stil join Sassou Nguesso grup wey be PCT. For October 2011, dem chuz am mek e dey among di pipul wey dey bring di rul wey evribodi for Congo go folo, na Senate of Congo-Brazzaville bi di nem. E join dem wen e dey wit PCT grup for Sangha Department. Wen dem dey chuz who and who go be di oga dem for Senate side, 61 pipu for Sangha chuz Abibi, na 87.14% of everibodi wey chuz who and who dem want mek e bí día oga dem. Dis one rili favor Abibi wel-wel, e kom mek win fest an kom stil mek am join one of di six post wey dey for Sangha." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Mount Evarest na di monten wey hi pas for di wold. E dey for one ples wey get bandri bitwin China an Nepal, an e tol rich 8,848.86m (29,031.7ft). Na di govament wey dey China an Nepal tok di meshoment for 2020. Na bikos of how Mount Evarest tol rich mek plenti pipul wey dia wok na to klaimb monten an oda pipul trai to klaimb am. Dis monten get two koret rod wey dem dey folo klaimb am. Di fest one na rod wey fez South for Nepal wey dem dey kol standard route wey bi di beta rod, an di sekond rod dey for North side for di smol siti for Tibet for China. Evun as e bi sey di beta road standard route no tu get plenti wahala to fit kliamb di maunten, na plenti danger dey for di oda road dem to tek kliamb di maunten like, strong wind, iceblok and oda wahala dem. Until di year 2019, pipul wey don pas 300 don die ontop di maunten an their bodi stil dey there. Pipul wey dia wok na to de kliamb maunten fom Britain bi di fest Pipul for rekod wey don trai to kliamb di maunten rish top kpatakpata." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "For di year 1953, pipul wey dey kliamb maunten from Britain kom bak Nepal for di 9th time wit their oga John Hunt to try rish di top. Hunt selet two (2) pipul wey dem nem na Tom Bourdillon and Charles Evans. Dem kliamb am and e remain smol like 100m (330ft) to rish di top for May 26 1953, bot dey kom bak bikos dem no get briz again. Two (2) days afta, Edmund Hillary wey kom fom New Zealand an Tenzing Norgay wey kom fom Nepal kliamb di maunten rish di top kpatakpata for (11:30) May 29, 1953. Afta som years don pas, Tenzing tok sey na Hillary fest put im leg for di top bifor am. Dem wait tek picture bifor dey kom daun. Di time wey di nuiz rish di queen Elizabeth II for Britain eye, E sey mek dey honor dem." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Wen Sylvanus stil bi speshal assistant to foma gofnor of Imo stet Rochas Okorochas for public Affairs, krimina pipul-dem kidnap am on December 15, 2012 for 2:30pm." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "For di 2006 komonwealth Games, Camille Michel wey komefrom Seycheles bit am 29:29. Durodola no fight for di 2007 ol-Afrika Games but e kwalify for di 2nd AIBA Afrikan 2008 Olimpik kwalifying Tornament as e bit Yekeni an som pipul. Di onli Olympic mach wey e kwulify for. E lose am to Osmay Acosta wey kom from kuban an na Akosta stil go win bronze medal for dat olimpiks. E sabi do knockout wel wel, na wetin e yus fight pipul wey no too sabi fight an na wetin e yus win dem. For 2011, Durodola don bikom beta fighta. E fight I'm fes kwarret fight for 19 Febuary for Memorial Hol wey dey for Kansas siti, Kansas. Dem leta kansu di fight bikos di pesin wey im wan fight komot hand wen time don almost rish. For 2013, Durodola win di WBC kontinentals Amerikas krusier Weight Shampionship kop an WBC Siva kruiserweights Shampion." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "di Federal high court fo Lagos freeze Stella Oduah four compani account becos dem dey owe plenti moni wey reach $16,412,819.06 and N100,493,225.59." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "inside Frans. Afta, i stop egen for Queenstown inside Ireland bifo i bigin travu go New York, bot for Apri 14 1912, as I de travu dey go i jos nak wan aisblok wey dey inside di oshon arand 11:40 for nait. Wota bigin rosh enta shapshap. Na du smol smol pikin an wumen dem de fes stat to put" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "fo di smo smo not dem bikos na wetin di law tok bi dat. Arand 2:20 for midnait, Titanik brek into tu wen pleti pipu stil dey inside am, an I sink bitwuin tu awas. Na jos 710 pipu dem fit sef for inside di kasala afta anoda big ship kom di pipu wey sovaiv." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Gregory Yunivasiti wey dey Uturu +dis one na pravate yunivasiti)." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "For 2006 census, Abuja get population of 776,298 people and 179,674 households, wey mek am one of di ten most populated sitis for Nijiria (number eight for 2006). Akoding to United Nations, Abuja grow reach 139.7% betwin 2000 and 2010, wey make am di fastest-growing city for di world that time.[13] As of 2015, di city still dey grow at least 35% every year, still holding di position as di fastest-growing city for Africa and one of di fastest for di world." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "On February 4 2022, Adekunle Gold rilis e 4th albom wey bi \"Catch Me if u Can\", di Albom get 14 traks, an som oda singa wey sing insaid bi Davido, Fautoumata Diawara, Lucky Daye, Stefflon Don, Foushee, an TY Dolla $ign." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Ibru be di former chairman of Rutam Motors. For 1983, him bin join hands with newspapermen Stanley Mecebuh of Daily Times of Nigeria, Dele Cole also formerly of that paper and Segun Osoba, wey bin dey Nigerian Herald come start The Guardian in 1983 with 55% of the money coming from the Ibru family, wey Alex Ibru come be chairman." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Aliko Dangote GCON (dem bon am for April 10, 1957) na Naijá bizness man an pesin wey dash pipul moni an propati. Na im bi di chairman and oga pata-pata for Dangote Group wey bi difren-difren kompini an na im get moni pass for di hol Afrika.Dangote bi di pesin wey get moni bikos for September 2021, rekod sho sey e get moni an propati wey rish $12.4 Billion Dolla." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Na Dangote bi di bak-bone of Olusegun Obasanjo for di eleshion wey e du for 2003, na im mek am gif am moni wey pass 200 Million (US$2 Million). E giv 50 Million Naira (US$500 Thousand) to di National Mosque bikos Obasanjo an Atiku na im frend dem. E still gif ₦200 Million to di Presidential Library. Di gift wey e dey gif PDP parti pipul plenti so tey pipu kon dey komplain sey mek magomago wey di Presido promis sey e no go dey no go folo dia enta di kontiri oo. For 2013, Bloomberg Billionaires Index sho sey e don add $9.2 Billion to di moni an propati wey e get an na dat one kom mek am di nomba 30 pesin wey get moni pass for di hol Wold an na im get moni pass for Afrika." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "For 2014, Naijá Gofment tok sey Dangote don dash Naijá 150 Million Naira ( US$750,000) mek dem yuz am tek fight Ebola. E stil dash Naijá 200 Million Naira (US$500,000) mek dem yuz am tek fight Coronal Virus (COVID19) so dat e no go kil pipul finish. Na Aliko Dangote an Femi Otedola stil promis sey dem go gif di Super Eagles Of Nigeria US$75,000 if dem skore goal for African Cup Of Nation(AFCON). Na Arsenal fans Dangote bi an e tok sey e wan bui di futbol klub, na Ingland di futbol klub dey." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Na di last day of di festival dem dey do competition where thousands of men go line up along di riverside, jump inside the river as dem hear the sound of gunshot come begin fish to see who go catch di biggest fish inside one hour. Di winner fit collect money wey reach $7,500 US dollars. Na only traditional fishing tools dem Competitors fit use and many people even like to catch fish with ordinary hand to show say dem sabi." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Rimi wok as pesin wi dey hep big big kompini laik UAC, NTC an G.B. OLLIVANT sel dia maket. Afta, e kom bi di oga kpata-kpata for African Circle Pollution Management. Rimi kom stil folo bi pat of di pipul wey get Commander Order of the Niger (CON). Na one waif im mari an dem don bon 7 pikin." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Dem bon Abubakar Sani Sambo for July 31, 1955 for Zaria, Kaduna Stet in Naijá.E kolet Bachelor of Science (B.sc) digree in Mechanical Engineering fom Ahmadu Bello University, Zaria in 1979 wit a fest klass In 1983.Sambo stil kolet doctorate digri, Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering fom di University of Sussex, United Kingdom. Afta e kolet Ph.D, Sambo kom bak to Naijá kon join di Bayero University, Kano where im kolet promoshon rish di posishon of a sinior leshura in 1989 an dem mek am di professor in Energy Study for di sem Univasiti. Dem mek Sambo di vice-chancellor of Abubakar Tafawa Balewa University in 1995 an e du am for two terms (1995-2004).Na Sambo bi di korent Dareto-General an chief executive of di Energy Commission of Nigeria (ECN) an vice chairman of di World Energy Council (WEC), Africa Region, sins November 2007." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Afta e kom bak fom United Kingdom, Adeniran fest stat to dey wok as pesin wey dey joj pipul mata for kot for Chief T.O.S Benson Chambers an e stil bi politishan. For 1956, e and im broda wey e nem na Sulu Ogunsanya join bodi togeda to stat Ogunsanya & Ogunsanya Chambers." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Agbassa na di nem of one of di two Urhobo kingdoms for Warri South Local Government, Delta State, Nigeria. Di oda one na Okere-Urhobo. Oyinbo people wey bi British na dem form di name 'Agbassa' from him original nem wey be 'AGBARHA', wey dem still dey use till today. Di king wey dey on top throne for Agbassa kingdom presently be H.R.M Orhifi Ememoh II, (ovie Of Agbarha Kingdom Warri)." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Agege Stadium na multi purpose stadium for Lagos Nigeria. E get seats capacity of 4000. Na house ground for MFM F. C., Nigeria women's national under 17 Football team and since 1918 of Dreamstar FC ladoes. state Government of Lagos talk say dem don try make dem complete di upgradation of di stadium for February as e dey for Nigeria news agency report." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "For 1936, e stat to dey among di pipul wey dey try mek dem riton di Bronze wey dey for Benin wey dem tif from di king haus an di ples wey dem tek dey serve dia gods bak to Naija wey hapun for di time wey dem atak di Benin pipul for 1897. Wen e stil bi di king, na onli two of di 3,000 royal court bronze dem riton bak to Naija. But dem riton two coral crown and coral bead garment wey dem biliv sey na Ovonramwen get dem an dem riton dem for di end of 1930. Di man wey riton dem na G.M. Miller an im papa folo pak dem di Benin propati an kom kari dem borrow di British Museum for 1935." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "For 1932, Ikoku biud di first sekondri skul for West Africa wia boi-dem an gel-dem dey len insaid di sem klas: di skul nem na Aggrey Memorial Secondary School, wey dey for Arochukwu an e giv am dat nem bikos of im gud ticha James E.K. Aggrey, wey bi one skul ticha from Ghana wey Dem sabi wel wel. For 1946, afta plenti chenj enta di lo buk to alau mor Nigeria pipul sit-daun insaid di lo haus, dem chuz am mek e join di Eastern Nigeria House of Assembly an dem put am insaid di ministri of edukeshon. For 1947, e join di big grup wey dey mek lo for Lagos as one of di three pipul wey stand for di Eastern pat of di kontri." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Kafanchan (5 September 1990; Im bishop na Marcus Dogo; Im first bishop na W. W. Diya, wey dem consecrate on 29 April 1990, Kaduna)" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "For October 20, 2020, wen End SARS protest dey happun, di gofnor tok set mek pipul for Legos no waka any how for 24-hour fom 4 p.m., E kom leta shift am to 9 p.m. bot jost bifor 7 p.m., souja an polis don kom skata pipul wey dey protest. Dem shoot an kil pipul wey dey protest an injor meni pipul for lekki Toll gate." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "2016 U.S. Presidential (PECASE) Award from President Obama" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Olu Ginuwa wey pipu stil sabi as Iginuwa na Naijá pesin wey bi di fest Olu of Warri. Olu Ginuwa bi di fest son of Oba Olua, wey bi di 14th Oba of Benin (1473–1480A.D.) an di pesin wey e sopoz bi di King of Gret Benin Kindom. E komot fom Benin Kindom an kom bi di fest Olu of Warri. Olu Ginuwa bi king for 30 years. Na fom 1480 to 1510 e bi king.E son Olu Ijijen (Ogbowuru) kom bi king afta am. Anoda of Olu Ginuwa sons, Olu Irame tek ova as king afta Olu Ijijen don dai" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Good Friday na holide wey govamet put hand mek pipul dey do in meni kontri of di wold an 12 U.S. stet too." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Gillard, Julia; Okonjo-Iweala, Ngozi (2020). Women and Leadership: Real Lives, Real Lessons. Penguin. p. 336. ISBN 9780143794288. Retrieved 11 2022." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "E bi awa disaia say aul di various naeshons wey dey subjekt to awa klemenci and moderashon, ga kontinu di profesion of dat religion wey bai di divine dey delivad to di Romans, as e don dey presavd bai feitful tradishon and wey nau dey profesd bai di Pontiff and bai di Bishop of Alexandria, a man of Saintli holines. Akodin to di Saintli (Santería) teachins and di doktrin of di Gospel, mek wi kontinu for di biliv of di Deiti of di Papa, di pikin and di diferen Spirits, for equal majesti and in holi Trinity. Wi authoraiz di folowas of dis law to azium di taitul Katolik Theodosian Code XVI.i.2" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Di main idea for di book be say if you dey wake up by 5:00 a.m., e fit really improve your personal and work life. Di billionaire talk say na dat early morning routine wey Spellbinder teach am make am succeed, as e help boost im creativity, energy, and productivity. Di book come introduce one method wey dem call “20/20/20 Formula,” wey divide di first one hour of your day into three parts: 20 minutes for exercise, 20 minutes for reflection, and 20 minutes for learning." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Barber kontiniu to dey draw fain fain tins wit pent an stone an for one buk insaid midu of 2017 e tok abaut im wok an wetin im biliv for laif." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Abba Musa Rimi, CON (wey dem bon for 28 Febuari 1940) na one man fom Naija wey pipul chuz mek e bi di pesin wey go rul dem for Kaduna Stet for 1979 wen Naija dey for dia Sekond Ripoblik, dis wan kom mek Rimi bi di pesin wey go dey du laik govno for dat taim wey dem komot Govno Abdulkadir Balarabe Musa as di govno for Jun 23, 1981. Na wen im dey insaid di pati for politis wey dem dey kol People's Redemption Party na im dem tek chuz am as di govno of Kaduna Stet." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Pope John Paul II kom Kaduna for Febuari 1982. Bot som pipul wey dey rul di muslim pipul dat taim no gri kom grit am. Wen di Pope stil dey di epot bifor im kom enta plen go bak to Lagos, e rid one tin wey dem rait giv Rimi an oda pipu wey dey wok for govment sey mek evribodi dey join bodi du tins togeda, weda yu bi muslim or kristen. For Ogost 1982, Rimi yuz gra-gra tok to di Jama'atul Nasril Islam (JNI) sey mek dem si as dem go fit stop di fait-fait wey dey among di smol smol muslim grup wey dia nem na Izala an Darika Muslim grup. For Mach 27 1982, dat taim, Rimi kom stat di IBBI Naija wey stil dey trai wel wel to dey du drink for Not said for Naija." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Afta Jenera Muhammadu Buhari yuz gra-gra bigin rul Naija for Disemba 31 1983, e arest som of di pipul wey dey rul difren difren Stet for Naija. For Mach 28 1985, dem send Rimi go 21 yias for insaid prizin. Dem sey im kari N500,000 dash 96 pipul for di Stet Haus of Asembli wey dey wok for ples wey dem dey join bodi rait evritin wey pipul sopoz du an di one wey dem no sopoz du. Rimi sey im giv dem di moni bikos dem \"folo du evritin wey dem sopoz du for dia difren difren eria." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "For Oktoba 1998, Rimi kom bi di pesin wey dey advais one soja-man wey bin dey rul Naija wey im nem na Abdulsalam Abubakar for di taim wey Naija chenj go di kain govment wey bi sey wu no bi soja fit rul Naija for di Nigerian Fourth Republic." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Di politeknik don dey sins 1992 afta di gofnor wey dey bifor for Sokoto Stet, Yahaya Abdulkarim sign di bill wey dem tek mek di \"Talata Mafara Polythecnic\". Di Sokoto Stet Govament chenj di nem of di Politeknik to \"Abdu Gusau Polytechnic\" in February, 1995. E du am to honor di late Enjinia Abdu Gusau wey dai in November, 1994 for all di tin wey e don du to divelop di Stet.Wen dey fom Zamfara Stet in 1996, dis one mek dem kari di Politeknik go a niu pamanet site in Talata Mafara. Di Sokoto Stet Govament no gree mek dey yuz dia moni to dey tekia of skul wey Zamfara get, an na dis risin mek dem kari Audi Gusau Politeknik fom Sokoto Stet to Zamfara Stet." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Abdullahi Mustapha (dem bon am for February 1, 1948) na Naija profesor of Medisinal kemistri an na forma fas shanselo for Ahmadu Bello Univasiti for Zaria. Na profesor Ibrahim Garba tek ova wen e komot as di fas shanselo (VC) for di Univasiti." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Dem bon profesor Mustapha for February 1, 1948.E papa am mama kom fom Katsina bot dem dey stey for Kano for Noth for Naija." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Na Abia Stet bi di nomba 32 stet wey big pas among all di Stet wey dey Naija an if we dey tok abaut Stet wey pipul plenti for Naija, Abia Stet kari nomba 27. Abia Stet get ova 3,720,000 pipo as of 2016." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Di land wey Abia Stet get na 6,320 square kilomitas." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Di Stet wey dey di North side an NorthEast of Abia Stet na Enugu Stet, an Ebonyi Stet.Di Stet wey dey for west side of Abia Stet na Imo Stet an Kross Riva Stey dey di East pat of Abia Stet.Na Rivas Stet dey di South of di Stet an Akwa Ibom Stet dey di Southeast. Di pat of Abia Stet wey dey south dey hey rain of 2,400 milimitas per years an rain dey plenti for April an October for di Stet.Di Rivas wey dey popula pass for di ples na Imo rivas an Aba rivas an dey flow enta Atlantik Osuhon for Akwa Ibom Stet." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Adekunle tok sey di fest moto wey e get na Honda 1999 'Baby Boy' (Accord) an na fom e frend for Ghana e buy am. Adekunle kon tok sey di moto skata wen im frend kari am Kombat. Gold tok sey e sel di moto for 400,000 naira, afta e don du di moto." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Adeleke kom stil kontest di Governorship Election of Osun State on July 16, 2022 onda di PDP wit APC gofnor Gboyega Oyetola an Adeleke kom win witb402,979 votes an Gboyega Oyetola get 375,077 votes. Di lokal Govament wey Adeleke win na 17 local govament arias an som of Dem na Olorunda, Ede South, Orolu, Osogbo, Odo Otin, Ifelodun, Atakumosa, and Ila." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Wahab stat to plai bol for ovasee for Italy for one Klub wey di nem na Reggiana.E bin plai wit Obafemi Martins an som oda Naija pleya-dem. For July 2001, Roma bin sign Wahab an Obafemi Martins for 3 billion lire from Reggiana and dem kolet Giuseppe Di Masi for 2.5 billion lire. For 2001-02 seesin dem loan Wahab bak to Reggiana.For di 2002-03 seesin e plai for Roma Primavera team an for 2003-04 seesin dem promot di tim go fest tim.Wahab plai one taim for Serie A an one taim for di 2003-04 UEFA Cup wen e enta for Daniele De Rossi against FK Vardar. Wahab stil plai for Bologna for di 2001 Torneo Citta di Arco." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Adunni Ade don wok for Housing and Insurance sectors for United States bifor e chenj to entatement indostrie.Adunni enta fashion modelling an sho for America's Next Top Model. Afta Adunni go bak to Naija, e fest Nollywood rol wey e akt na one yoruba langwej fim wey get di nem You or I for 2013.E pass 170,000 wey luk di smol vidio komedi skesh “Date Gone Bad” wey Adunni rilis for YouTube for 2014.Adunni don akt inside meni oda Nollywood fim both for Inglish an Yoruba langwej, inkludin som muzik vidio for Sound Sultan an Ice Prince.E risif Stella Awod fom di Nigerian Institute of Journalism for di wok e dey du to promot Nigerian Kolshor." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Akure na city wey dey for southwestern Naija an im bi di kapital siti. Na im big pas for Ondo stet. E get pipul wey rish like 484,798 for 2006 population census." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Abimbola Olatilewa Amusu na Naija solja wey dey kontrol di \"Nigerian Army Medical Corps\" fom 2015 go rish 2018. Amusa na di sekond fimel ofisa for di histri of di Nigerian Army Medical Corps to kontrol di corps. Dem pik am afta Major General Obashina Ayodele ritaya." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Amusu get Masta of Business Administration (MBA) (Health Management) fom \"Lagos State University\". E na examiner wit di \"National Postgraduate Medical College of Nigeria\" an na memba of Faculty Board; \"Faculty of Pathology\", for di sem kolej. Amusu na di authority of di Nigerian Army Medical Corps.E join Naijá Armi as 2nd Lieutenant for June 1982. Amusu don bi dareto an Shif Konsotant \"Hematologist\", \"44 Nigerian Army Reference Hospital\" Kaduna fom September 2014 go rish December bifor dem mek am Medikal Corps Komanda. Amusa dey dis ofis ontil e ritaya for December 2018. E bi one of di two Major jenerals an three Brigadier jenerals wey dem ritaya fom di Nigerian Army Medical Corps for Lagos for 2018." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Dey decide to make chief David Oghenegueke Dafe as deir Ovie (king) and chief Joseph Ajarho Atagana from Umiaghwa as deir Otota (spokesman). D recent history show say Avwraka (Abraka) don reach to divide di kingdom into Umiagwa Abraka and Oruarive Abraka kingdom. After di two separate Avwraka (Abraka) kingdoms Now dem form vital part wey be Ethiope-East local Government Area of Delta State wey di polity dey don live dere since 1976. Di main pipu wey dey di city of Abraka na di urhobo pipu." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Abuja na di administrative and political capital of Nigeria. E still be very important capital for Africa because of Nigeria geopolitical influence for regional matters. Abuja na also conference centre wey dey host many meetings every year, like di Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting 2003 and di World Economic Forum on Africa 2014. Abuja join UNESCO Global Network of Learning Cities for 2016." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Abuja Stock Exchange (ASE) dem set am up fo 2000 an e kom enta show fo 2001. Na di first exchange fo Naija to kari elektronik enta maket, dem dey do clearing and settlement fo smal an big maket-dem." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Dem bon Baba-Kutigi for June 10, 1956. E du e sekondiri skul for Government Secondary School Eyagi, Bida wey dey for Naijá Stet. Adamu bin kolet one satifiket for 1979 wey bi Nigerian Certificate in Education(NCE) fom Teachers Training College Minna wey dem don dey kol College of Education Minna. E go University of Sokoto wey dem don dey kol Usman Danfodio University. Na dia e get Bachelor of science degree for Physics. E leta du e masta an Ph.D for Physics fom ABU Zaria. Adamu get esperiens for tishin an risahi, an e dey di Student Teachers Association of Nigeria (STAN) grup.Adamu stil dey di Nigeria Institute of Physics (NIP) grup, e dey di Nigeria Association of Teachers Technology (NATT) grup. Adamu don before bi di Deputi-Dareto Center for Preliminary and Extra Moral Studies an stil bi memba of di Governing Council wey dey repiset di congregation for Federal University of Technology, Minna." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Di pipul wey dem dey kol di Governing Council of di Federal University Dutsinma, Katsina mek di Professor Adamu Nchama Baba-Kutigi di niu Aktin Vice-Chancellor of di univasiti. Di senate of di univasiti nominate am for di 73rd emergency mitin wey dem du for March 2019. Bifor dem giv am dat posishion, Prof. Nchama Baba-Kutigi bi di forma Dean of di Faculty of Science an e bi di forma Head of Department of Physics for di univasiti." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Na for inside 1940 an 1944 im stat im skul for ’'Jimeta Elementary School, afta dis one e kom go Yola Middle School go rish 1947. E stil go Barewa kolej for Zaria fom 1947 go rish 1950 an for inside 1954 go rish 1956 e go kolej of teknoloji. E stil go yunivasiti of Ibadan an na dia dem giv am one satifiket for Modern History for 1960." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "E bi like 700 km southwest of Abuja an 311 km north of Lagos State. Di town dey for tropical rainforest zone of Naijá." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "for 2005, di fish wey win di competition bin weigh 75kg and big so tey na four men fit carry am put for scale. For 2006,di festival bin ban fishing on top safety concern for low water levels. As di festival dey important reach to the economy of the state, the government bin ban di use of gill and cast nets make dem take conserve fish stock. The Zauro polder project, wey bi one irrigation scheme on top Rima River floodplain wey dey south of Argungu, na him dem don criticize sake of say the reservoir wan flood di traditional site wia dem dey do di festival." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "polycrystalline graphene using chemical vapour deposition, creating di fess 300 mm wafers. In 2011 im publish di fess textbook on Carbon Nanotube and Graphene Device Physics with Prof. Philip Wong of Stanford University. Dem mek am a sinior member of Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE) for 2013.I don mek meni advances for two dimensional graphene electronics. For 2015 e" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "and The Boy is Good. Dem shot Most of i fim with 16mm with di exception of The Mask. Later for i karia Ugbomah turned to Yoruba video fim. For 1988, Dem appoint am as di chairman of di Nigerian Film Corporation. Ugbomah kpai for 11 May 2019, for di age of 78." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Wen e dey du di medisine, almost all di tins wey dem yuz du di medisine kom fom Liverpool for United Kingdom. Na acetylsalicylic acid an caffeine bi di main tins wey Alabukun pauda get. One paket of Alabukun get 760 mg of acetylsalicylic acid and 60 mg of caffeine wey kom mek evritin bi 820 mg and odas tins wey dey mek di medisine last long and evritin kom get 1000mg pauda an di total weight go rich 1400mg. Som of di tins di medisine dey wok for headik, pesin wey teeth dey pain, pesin wey throat dey pain, e dey hep mek blood no gum togeda for bodi like sey na akamu, pesin wey bodi dey pain, heart attak, pesin wey im blood no dey flow wel for bodi an pesin wey no dey breet wel. Dis medisine dey wok wel wel an e dey hep put adenosine for inside bodi. E dey hep stop pain for bodi an hep pesin to dey breath fine. If pesin no yuz am wel, e fit kos mek plenti tins like wota plenti for pesin bodi, e fit no mek pesin breet wel, e fit dey mek pesin vomit, an e fit mek pesin belle dey du am one kind and e go mek pesin eye dey see doubu" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Mushin na one of di Lokal Govament Aria for Lagos. Mushin dey for 10km north for di siti Sentra veri near to di main road for Ikeja, an na ples wey plenti plenti pipul dey stey an di aria dey veri dirti bikos di meni hause for Mushin no get toilet.Wen dey kount pipul for 2006, Di pipul wey dey stey Mushin na 633,009." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Ogun State get boda with Republic of Benin for west side for about 185 km. For north, e border Oyo State and Osun State (about 84 km), while Ondo State dey for east. For south, e share border with Lagos State for laik 283 km, and e still get laik 31.6 km coastline for Bight of Benin." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Okene na one town for Kogi stet. Di town dey for di lokal govment wey get di send nem as Okene. Di aria wey di town kova rish 328 km² an pipul wey dey liv there rish 320,260 for 2006 wen dem bi du sensos." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Kutlu Adalı (1935–1996), na one man from Turkey wey dey tel evribodi as tins tek dey hapun for evriwhere, e dey stil sing smol smol muzik, an im dey always chuk eye for politis mata an im sabi find out abaut how some kind tins be an e dey always tel pipul sey wahala no gud." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Adewale Dauda Wahab (dem bon am for October 4, 1984) na Naija futbola wey dey plai midfield posishion. Im bin dey plai for AC Bellinzona til di end of 2010-2011." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "For 2007, AC Bellinzona sign Wahab. For di 2009-10 seesin, e go SE Eivissa-Ibiza an e plai smol frendili mash wit dem.Di Klub no du di transfa bikos dem komot di klub fom wey dem dey. Afta som taim dem vet pamishion to enta bot as niu klub wey dem dey kol UD Ibiza-Eivissa." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "For October an November, Wahab plai two lig games for Bellinzona. For January 2010, dem no add e nem for di tim bot dey leta add am for di offishial tim rosta for 2010-11 seesin." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Foma Ogun stet govnor Olusegun Osoba hod di tradishona title wey be Otun of Ago-oba among oders. For April 2011 presidential election Osoba kast im vote for Ago-Oba for kandidate Nuhu Ribadu of di Action Congress of Nigeria. Ribadu na dem tok di wina for di wod wit 142 votes to 65 for PDP and 5 for CPC. Foma president Olusegun Obasanjo im be Owu pipul. Wen im wife Stella Obasanjo die for 2005, dem kari di bodi from Legos kom winners chapel for Ago-Oba from there dem kom Kari ha go beri for Obasanjo famili kompound wey dey near ita-Eko. Alexander Adebayo Bada (1930-2000) sekond lida for di Celestial Church of Christ Worldwide im na son of di Baale or Paramount hed of Ago-oba foma president of di Ikeja customary court for Lagos. Di seriki of Egbaland, Dr. Lateef Adegbite get im Ofis for Ago-oba." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": ".Chairman, Joint Academic and Non Academic staff Union Plateau State Tertiary institutions(1992-1994)" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Dem make Akenzua II di Oba of Benin for April 1933 afta im papa wey bi Ewekw II don kpai (r.1914-1933) for February dat year. Oba Akenzua II rili mek sure sey di Edo pipul go skul wel wel." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Dem bon am 1934 for Abeokuta, di kapita of Ogun State, Southwestern Naija. I die for November 2012. Afta im stop skool im mama carry am give im grandmama. Im fest go learn tailor im stat to dey learn sins i don dey put eye for Baba GT Onimole. According to watin Im brother tok i fest pla na \"a terrible life\" and im stage nem na Baba Ibeji. Im don feature, direkt and produce meni Naija fim like Ireke Onibudo and 50-50 wey dem produces in 1990 wey feature ogbonge funny aktor Bolaji Amusan." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "For January 2022, di Pipuls Gazette riport sey Sanwo-Olu administrashion don inkris di monthly moni wey Legos dey pay to Alpha Beta LLC fom ₦800 million to ₦2.5 billion.Di desishun of di Govament to dey pay Alpha Beta big moni to handu tax mata don dey kos wahala tey tey bikos na di forma Legos Stet Gofnor Bola Tinubu dey kontrol Alpha Beta. Dem stil tok sey di moni inkris bikos of Tinubu nid moni to du im 2023 presidenshial kampan." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "King of Darhomey, dey sel pipu wey e karch for war giv pipu wey dey buy slav abi mek e uze dem du rishual wey dem dey du evri year. For 1750, King Dahormey don get lik €250,000 for one year on top Afrika pipu e dey sel giv Oyibo pipu. Dem dey kol di plez \"Slave Coast\" bikos of na dia dem tek du di selin biznes. But di nomba of pipu wey e dey sel go down bikos of wetin kourt tok. Di nomba fom 102,000 go down in ten years in di 1780's to 24,000 by 1860's. Anoda tin wey mek am go down na bikos of di Slave Trade Act 1807by Britian in 1808, wey stop selin of pipu." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "moved to Paris to take part. She writ di screenplay for B for Boy (2013) during ha two-and-a-half-week stay.Anadu produce di fim with ha independent kompany No Blondes produkshon. Dey shot di fim for 17days, with Anadu working as direktor, writa, produsa, casting direktor, location scout, accountant, and lawyer. Na family money dem use du di fim.Anadu family contribute 70% of di cost, and ha producing partner Arie Esiri family contribute di remaining 30%. Dey sho B for Boy (2013) at di BFI London fim festival in 2013.Dem sho am for AFI where i win AFI fest 2013 Breakthrough Aword with $5,000 cash prize. Di fim premiere for Durban South Africa on July 19, 2014." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Origi stat im futbol karier for Lille an skore im fest goal for dem for 2013. Afta one year an half Liverpool sign am for dia klub for €10 million by Liverpool, but im kom go bak to Lille as dem boro am for 2014-2015 year." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "For Ova 15 years di kompini dey du di disign and implementation of projects of abaut $2bn. Di engineering services division held services for A.W. Chesterton of Boston, Mass and Hewlett Packard (1982). For 1981 dem kolabo with Earth Technology Corporation of California for geotechnical and geophysical surveying and mapping. Anoda venture wey involve Israeli cover architectural planning. Di kompini kolet 30 enjinias an 10 experts to wok for dem.Fom 1980, di grup bigin dey divelop robas farms and dey don establish one roba makin kompini. Di grup also dey into Insurance brokerage an tradin for di oil indostri. Dem stil get hand for banking, poblishin an propati. Edet Amana na di founding dareto of Citybank Nigeria Limited an im saf for di board of di Bank fom 1985-2010. Todey, Edet Amana na di Chairman of Amana Group of Company an na im" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "On 26 July 2017, Sarr signed for four years for ligue one side Rennes. Dem pey transfer moni for Metz wey bi €17 or 20 million e depends on di source." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "For 2005, President Olusegun Obasanjo announce sey them wan privatize the National Theatre. This on cause diagreement amongst Nigerian entertainers and playwrights like Wole Soyinka On 30 December 2014, report come sey them done sell National Theatre to one Dubai-based conglomerate for the sum of $40million, and them go convert the building to duty-free shopping mall." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "For 2012, the state government form a joint Venture wey bring SAB Miller Brewery come invest for Onitsha Brewery wey start for August 2012. Na the first big investment for inside Onitsha since when them establish Premier Brewery wey be the maker of Premier beer for the early part of1980. For January they announce sey if them upgrade the brewery with $110million, production of beer and malt drinks go triple." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Na Mayor Ville Entertainment wey dey sign pipul wey dey sing na dem Obesere sign kontrat for now. Mayor Ville Entertainment dey onda Maxoglan Entertainment wey dey Lagos for Naijà." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "E go Ralmadadi Praimari skul for 1955 bifor e go Katsina sekondri skul. E kolet e West African Examination Certificate for 1968 for Gofment kolej, Keffi. E leta go Ahmadu Bello Univasiti for 1973 wia e kolet e bashelo digri for Pharmacy. E stil kolet e Doctorate degree(Ph. D) fom Chelsea College wey dey leta join wit King's College for London in 1981." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Abia State bi a Stet wey dey Saut-Eas jiopolitikal zon of Naija. Di Stet bi wan of di 36 Stet for Naija and di kapita na Umuahia. Di ples wey bizness dey pas na Aba for di Stet. Di state slogan na \"God's Own State\" and di governor of di state bi Okezie Ikpeazu. Di Stet wey dey di North side an NortEas of Abia Stet na Enugu Stet, an Ebonyi Stet. Di Stet wey dey for wes side of Abia Stet bi Imo Stet an Kross Riva Stey dey di Eastan pat of Abia Stet. Na Rivas Stet dey di Saut of di Stet an Akwa Ibom Stet dey di Sauteas." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Di wod ABIA kom from di ples inside Abia Stet wey pipul plenti pass. Di A stand for Aba, Di B stand for Bende, Di I stand for Isuikwuato an di A stand for Afikpo." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Many tribe-dem don stey an liv for Abia Stet, but for nau na Igbo pipul dey liv for Abia Stet. Bifor di Oyinbo pupil kom Naija, Abia Stet dey pat of Arochukwu-based Aro Union bifor di British souja fight di Arọ grup kom win dem for 1900s. Wen di Oyingbo win di war finish, dey kom add di aria to Sautan Naija wey dey go dey kontrol as pat of Naija. Abia Stet giv di Oyingbo pupil dem wahala biko dey no wan stey onda dem an di korse Wumen war wey hapun stat for Oloko." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Abia Stet na one of di 36 stet wey dey Naija an di Stet get 17 lokal govament aria out of di 774 lokal govament aria wey dey Naija.Na for August 27, 1991 dey kret Abia stet.Na Jeneral Ibrahim Babangida rijim time na e dey kret am.Di Stet dey South-Easta pat of Naija.Na for inside Imo Stet dey tek komot Abia Stet. Di Stet dey amog di Stet wey mek-up Niger Delta rijion.Umuahia bi di kapital of Abia Stet.Na Aba for Abia Stet Bizness dey hapun pass for di Stet. Di nik nem of Abia Stet na \"Stet wey bi dey na God get am\". Di fest leta for di four ples for di Stet wey pipul plenti pass mek-up di nem ABIA dey bi" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Aba, Bende, Isuiwuato, Afikpo.If pesin divadi pipul wey dey Abia Stet into one hundred, ninety five of dem go bi Igbo pipul.Na Igbo langwej Abia pupil dey spik pass but dem dey spik Inglish too for bizness an govament mata. Pipul wey bi kristen for Abia pass 7 million." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Abia Stet get Abia Stet kolej of Edukeshion (teknikal) wey dey Arochukwu. Dey get Abia Stet kolej of Health Sayens an Manejiment Tekinoloji wey dey Aba. Temple Gate Polytechnic dey Aba too" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Dem bon am for Jos for inside Naija. Im na Idoma pesin. Idoma dey for di south side for Naija." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "E get one time wey im bi pat of voice of hiling wey Gordon Lindsay fest stat." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Abala-Ibeme wey dem stil sabi as Abala na vilej for Obingwa Lokal Govment Area wey dey for inside Abia State for Naija." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "American Faaji Series 1&2 (Dudu Heritage)" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Abdu Gusau Polytechnic na one Stet Govament politeknik wey dey for Talata Mafara, Zamfara Stet inside Naija." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Na for 1974 Profesaw Mustapha stat e tishin wok for Ahmadu Bello tishin Ospital as Pupil Pharmacist. An na for 1982 dem promot am go Senior Lekshora for di Dipatment of famasitikal an medisinal kemistri. For 2010, dem giv am fas shanselo for Ahmadu Bello Univasiti. Bifor e bikom fas shanselo for Ahmadu Bello Univasiti, e bin dey saf as di fas shanselo for Umaru Musa Yar'adua Univasiti." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Jiografikali, di Stet divide into two, di \"Niger Delta Swamp forest\" an di dry \"'Crosss-Niger transition Forest\" wit som Savana for di rest of the Stet." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Wen Naija free from Oyingbo in 1960, Dey kari Abia Stet join di Eastan Rijion onti 1967 bifor dey kom add am to East Sentral Rijion.E no rush two month leta, Abia Stet pipul join di three years Naija Sivul war as Abia pipul tok sey dey komot from Naija go join Biafra Reploblik.Wen di War end, dey kom join Abia Stet bak to Stet wey dey Naija bak ontil 1976 wen forma Presidor Murtala Muhammed era wen dey kom komot Imo Stet fom Ábíá Stet." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Di langwej wey dem dey uze wok for ofis dia na French, but dey get some oda lokal langwuej wey bi Fon, Bariba, Yoruba an Dendi. Christian wey dey kontri plenti pas oda religion pipu (52.2%), folo by Islam (24.6%) an tradishonal pipu (17.9%). Benin na United Nations memba, di Afrika Union, di Economic Community of West Africa State, di Organization of Islamic Cooperation, di South Atlantic Peace an Cooperation Zone, Francophonie, di Community of Sahel- Sahara States, di Africa Petroleum Producers Association, an di Niger Basin Authority membas." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Charles kontest for New Jersey State Senate in 1959, as e shalenj Donal C. Fox di Demokrat wey bi di pesin wey dey ofis dat taim.Charles kontest on top di Essex Republican Organization platform wit sopot of County Chairman William Yeomans bot e faze one strong opponent in di GOP primary: bifor bifor Stet Senator Alfred C. Clapp, who bin don gree to lid som kandidate wey bin get som reform agenda wey dey difren fom dat of William Yeomans. Na so Clapp kom tek win Webb wit votes wey passs 20,000(31,551 (72%) to 12,177 (28%)) an all his 12 Assembli kandidate kom win di primari. Na dis Webb defit for 1959 pamari kom klair road for Congressman Robert W. Kean to defit William Yeomans insaid di eleshion for Essex County Republican Chairman one week leta." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "This research breakthrough was selected as one of di top science stories of 2015 by Diskova magazine. Di silicene wok na di most cited Nature Nanotechnology publication of similar age.Im demonstrate di thinnest most transparent electronic tattoo sensors wey e use graphene for 2017, wey dey less Dan 500nm thick and 85% optically transparent. Dis research na collaboration wok with Nanshu Lu's group. Dem fit laminate di tattoos inside persin skin like temporary tattoo,but e fit measure electrocardiography, electroencephalography, temperature and hydration. Later dem develope graphene tattoos to watin persin fit wear for bodi to monitor blood pressure continously using di" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ekwunife don kontest fo Anambra governorship election two taim but shi no win. Dem elekt Ekwunife fo 2007 to represent Anambra's Anaocha/Njikoka/Dunukofia constituency. Shi bi one of 11 women wey dem elekt fo 2007, wey dem still re-elekt fo 2011 wen di lower haus almost bi 95% men.Oda women wey dem elekt na Juliet Akano, Mulikat Adeola-Akande, Abike Dabiri, Nkiru Onyeagocha, Nnena Elendu-Ukeje, Olajumoke Okoya-Thomas, Beni Lar, Khadija Bukar Abba-Ibrahim, Elizabeth Ogbaga and Peace Uzoamaka Nnaji." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Whitemoney na di winner for di show wen dem announce am on 3 Octoba 2021, e get 46% votes as Liquorose get 22.99% dat mek am kolet 90 million naira prize." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Plenty pipu for de state (~85%) bi Christian, wey small number of pipu bi Muslim, come join nah very small pipu wey bi dey practice traditionalist wey bi 10% and 5%." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ogu pipul wey som pipul dey kol Egun pipul, na one tribe wey dey for Lagos State an Ogun State for Naijá. Ogu pipul get difren-difren metod of spikin dia langwej wey som of dem na Thevi, Xweka, Ṣètò an Toli. Ogu pipul na abaut 15% of di pipul wey dey Legos an na dia Stet of orijin." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "For 2005, dem estimate say over 2 billion pipul dey wey sabi speak English.[4] English na di first foreign langwej wey most learners wey get anoda main langwej dey learn. E be official langwej for United Nations, European Union, and plenti oda international oganizations. English na di most widely-spoken Germanic langwej, with at least 70% of Germanic speakers dey sabi English. About 220 million oda pipul dey use am as their second langwej. E dey important well well for science, technology, work, travel, and trade, and at least one billion pipul dey learn am. All dese things combine make English the largest langwej by number of speakers." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Na Cuppy foto dey di furont kova of Guardian Life Magazine. Di magazine de tak abaut young wimen fo Africa.Fo March 2015, na Cuppy Oil Barons Charity pick mak i do DJ for dem in Dubai. Dis chariti show we i go do DJ make am di nọba wan Afirica pesin we go do dat kind tin for Oil Barons Charity.Cuppy de di 2015 April/May magazine of Forbes Wuman Africa." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Demi Isaac Oviawe (dem bon am November 2 2000)na Nijiria-bon Irish aktres. Pipu sabi ha for di role wey shi akt as Linda Walsh for 2018 RÌÉ/BBC komdi siries The Young Offenders. For 2017 di Irish Examiners wey ha nem na Oviawe as one of their annual \"ones to watch for 2018\". Shi appear for 2019 series of di Irish edition of Dancing with the stars. Shi komot for di competishon February 17 an na shi bi di fes celibriti wey dem vote komot." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Iyamho na dey small town in Etsako West local government area of Edo State, Nigeria. Edo University, Iyamho is located here. Iyamho na one of the 21 towns/villages that constitute Uzairue clan in Etsako West, Edo State. The major religions include Christianity, Islam and traditional religion." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "In kontras to di strongli seasonal atmosfe of Uranus, wey fit dey feachorles for long periods of taim, Neptun atmosfe get ativ and konsistentli visibul weda patans. As at di taim of di Voyaija&nbsp;2 flaibai for 1989, di planet sautan hemisfe get a Great Dak Spot wey dey komparabul to di Great Red Spot for Jupita. For 2018, a niua main dak spot and smola dak spot kom dey identifaid and stodid. Diz weda patans dey driven bai di stronges sustaind winds of eni planet for di Sola System, as hai as 2100km/h|m/s mph. Bekaus of e great distans from di Sun, Neptun auta atmosfe bi wan of di koldes plaesis for di Sola System, wit temperechors for e kloud tops dey aproach 55K|C F. Temperechots for di centa of di planet bi aproximateli 5400K|C F. Neptun get a faint and fragmented ring system (wey dey labeld as \"arks\"), wey wi diskova for 1984 and wey Voyaija 2 konfam." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "For February 2023, na Adeyemi bi di playa wey sabi run pass for di hole Bundesliga. E speed na 36.65 km/h (22.7 mph)." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "‌In 2006, dem giv Ezekwesili nashonal awod of Commander of di Order of di Fediral Repoblik of Nigeria (CFR)." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": ".‌‌In May 2012, dem giv Ezekwesili honorary Doctor of Science (DSC) digre fom Universiti of Agriculture, Abeokuta insaid Nigeria. Shi dey insaid BBC's 100 Women in 2013 an 2014." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": ".‌‌In July 2016, dem giv am honorary graduate digre by University of Essex, United Kingdom." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": ".‌‌In March 2019, Ezekwesili win Forbes Women Afrika Social Influencer Awod bikos hau shi tek di #BringBackOurGirls campaign." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "‌.In 2019, dem giv am Awod of Richard Von Weizsäcker Fellowship at di Robert Bosch Academy in Berlin." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Daniel Jones (12 Septemba 1881 - 4 Disemba 1967) bụ onye ụda olu Britain gụrụ akwụkwọ n'okpuru Paul Passy, ​​prọfesọ nke phonetics na École des Hautes Études na Sorbonne (Mahadum Paris). Ọ bụ onye isi ngalaba nke ụda olu na University College London." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "N'afọ 1900, Jones gụrụ akwụkwọ nkenke na William Tilly's Marburg Language Institute na Germany, bụ ebe e bu ụzọ webatara ya na ụda ụda. N'afọ 1903, ọ natara akara ugo mmụta BA ya na mgbakọ na mwepụ na mahadum Cambridge, na n'aka nri ya MA na 1907. Site na 1905 ruo 1906, ọ gụrụ akwụkwọ na Paris n'okpuru Paul Passy, ​​onye bụ otu n'ime ndị malitere International Phonetic Association, na 1911, ọ lụrụ nwa nwanne Passy Cyrille Motte. O were obere oge nweta nkuzi nkeonwe site n'aka onye ụda olu Britain bụ Henry Sweet." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Dem bon am for one pat of Legos wey bi Ikorodu for January 31, 1918 insaid one famili wey dey rul wey bi Omoba Suberu Ogunsanya Oguntade wey bi di Odofin of Ikorodu. E finish im primari skul for Hope Waddell Training Institute for kalabar an na one of im papa broda wey dey wok for govament train am.Wen dey rait di Govament Standard VI ezam for 1937, na Adeniran Ogunsanya get mark wet hi pas. Dis one kom mek govament pai for all e skul moni an buk as dem send am go King's College for Legos. Adeniran stil go rid lo for big big skul laik University of Manchester an Gray's school of law." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Omo n'Oba n'Edo Uku Akpolokpolo, Akenzua II (January 7, 1899 – June 11, 1978) na Oba of Benin (di pesin wey dey rule di pipul wey kom from Edo for inside Naija) from 1933 to when e kom kpai for 1978." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Oba Akenzua II kpai for June 11 1978 an im pikin wey dem dey kol Prince Solomon dat time kom tek ova. E kom chenj im title to Oba Erediauwa an kom bigin dey rule di Edo pipul wey dey inside Naija." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "teem win Real Madrid. Fo January 11, 2020, Oshoala skore four goals fo insaid di 6-0 wey im teem win CD Tacon. Na Barcelona dey fo nomba 1 fo di table dat year. Na Oshoala bi di sekond person wey skore pas, shi skore 20 goals." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ayo Adesanya stat ha Karia in 1986 afta shi complet di National Youth Service Scheme (NYSC) In 1996, Ayo Adesanya join di Naija fim industri (Nollywood) professionali and shi stat ha professiona akting karia, shi appear on television for DI fest time on Tunji Bamishigbin's soap opera wey di nem bi Palace. Ayo Adesanya lata joined di Yoruba-language film industri, where shi don feature, produs and direkt meni meni fim, Ayo Adesanya dey du English-languwej fim tu." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Di fest fim wey shi akt na Mojere, wey bi Yoruba fim. Dem give ha best actress at di REEL Awards. In 2015 Mogaji tok sey na lie say fim makers prefer young aktors and aktress in Nollywood. Shi explain am sey their reason no fit bí bikos of professionalism, bikos nothing wey young aktor dey do wey di old ones no fit do. In 2018 di interview with di Punch, Mogaji explain sey shi never akt semi-nude or kiss inside fim throughout DI and time wey shi take bí aktress. Shi tok sey produsas know di kín rol wey shi fit pla." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Him pass Staff College (Psc) for 1990,get Diploma for Business Administration for 1998,Doctor of Civil Law (DCL) Honoris Causa for LAUTECH, Ogbomoso for 2006 come join Doctor of Science (Political Science) Honoris Causa, Lead City University, Ibadan for 2008." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "For July 2014, she do ha first CD we get plenti plenti different song and im name am House of Cuppy and di parti happun for New York on September 2, 2014. For di same year, Cuppy opun i podorshion group we bi Red Velvet Music Group and na London di group dé" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Abibatu Mogaji FCM, OON (dem bon am for October 16, 1916 an e kpai for June 15, 2013) na Naija biznes wuman an di lyaloja of Lagos." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Shif Mogaji bi di mama of di National Leader of di All Progressive Congress (APC) an gofnor of Legos Stet one time wey e nem na shif Bola Tinubu.Shif Tinubu pikin wey bi gel wey e nem na Folashade an na Folashade tek ova fom di granma as di lyaloja of Legos." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Na Abimbola wan bi di produsa of Skinny Gel in Transit bifor di plan chenj to mek im kuku bi di aktresof di fim. Sins sisin 1, Abimbola no jos akt as di lidi aktres, but shi don produs Sisin 2 go rish Sisin 6 for SGIT.Abimbola join produs di fim “Sugar Rush” for 2019 wit Jadesola Osiberu." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "E wok smol as trainee jornalist for Daily Sketch bifor e join British Council for 1987 bot resign for 2006 wen e hosband Babatunde Fashola bikom di kandidate wey Action Congress of Nigeria (APC) pik for Gofnor eleshon." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Senator Isiaka Abiola Adeyemi Ajimobi (dem bon am for December 16, 1949 an e kpai for June 25, 2020) na Naija politishian wey kom fom Oyo State, sauth-west of Naija. Im na bifor bifor oga kpatakpata for National Oil and Chemical Marketing Company wey dey onda di kompini wey Shell Petroleum, Nigeria dey kontrol.Ajimobi ritaya komot for orye mata for 2002 afta 26 years of koret savis an e kom kontest an win eleshion go senate to repisent Oyo South Senatorial District on top di platfom of Alliance for Democracy (AD) party. Afta Ajimobi finish one term for senate, e kom join kolet gofnorship fom in 2007 wen e kontest bot e no win di gofnorship eleshion for Oyo Stet onda di parti of di All Nigeria People's Party. Ajimobi kontest again insaid di April 2011 gofnorship eleshions onda di Action Congress of Nigeria an dis taim e kom win di eleshion na so e tek bi di gofnor of Oyo Stet. Afta Ajimobi du two terms as gofnor fom 2011 go rish 2019, Ajimobi kolet senate fom for eleshion but e lost di eleshion.Ajimobi kpai on 25 of June 2020, an na COVID-19 sikness kos am." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Bachelor of Science degree satifiket for di Univasiti. Afta dat, Ajimobi go du MBA for Operations Research and Marketing as e put eye for Finance in Governors State University, University Park, for di city of Illinois inside di United States of America." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Pipul no Ajimobi as sombodi wey plan how Oyo Stet go tek fine wel wel.Evribodi no Ajimobi as fada of Oyo Stet. Wen Ajimobi win di sekond eleshion in April 11, 2015 as gofnor of Oyo Stet, dis mek am di fest pesin to du gofnor bak to bak in Oyo Stet. For June 16, 2020, Di National Working Committee(NWC) of APC for dia mitin chuz Ajimobi as di aktin National Chairmanof di All Progressives Congress (APC)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "On June 19 2020, dem rosh Ajimobi go one hospitu for Lagos Stet wey dem dey kol First Cardiologist and Cardiovascular Consultants Hospital afta COVID-19 mek am dey Koma. Ajimobi kpai on June 25, 2020.Ajimobi wife Florence Ajimobi an e five pikin stil dey for life wen e kpai." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Alimosho na one lokal govamet inside lkeja wey dey inside Lagos State for Naija. Na di lokal govamet big pass for all di lokal govamet wey dey for Legos Stet. Alimosho get 1,288,714 pipo. Na as dem kaunt evribodi wey dey inside Naija for 2006 dem tok dis one ( Legos Stet govamet sey na big lie bí dat ooo!dem sey di pipo plenti pass like dat, dem say di nomba of pipo wey dey live for Alimosho lokal govamet pass 2 million). Alimosho lokal govamet don brake to smol smol into Lokal Komuniti Divelopmet Aria (LCDA). Dis LCDA start to dey wok afta Mr Bola Ilori finish to dey in kontro of di old single Alimosho lokal govamet. Alimosho skata into six smol- smol lokal Komuniti Divelopmet Aria wey dia names na:" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Aminu Bello Masari enta for sekond taim as gofnor of Katsina Stet for March 9, 2019 onda All Progressives Congress (APC) Masari get 1,178,864 vote for di Kastina Stet Govno Eleshon." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Di person wey catch the biggest fish for 2020 Argungu Fishing Festival wey weigh around 78 kilograms na him dem give N10 million, two new cars plus two Hajj seats. Di person wey dey second and third position self get gifts. Na Over 50,000 fishermen dey participate for this yearly festival for Kebbi State and na di person wey catch the biggest fish be di winner. The President of Nigeria, Muhammadu Buhari bin attend the 60th edition of Argungu Fishing Festival for 2020 after dem don stop am for 10years." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Badagry (wey dem de call Gbagli for lokal langwej) na one tanwn wey dey near di riva an na Lokal Government Eria (LGA) wey dey inside Legos Stet, for Naija. I dey very klos to di citi of Legos, and i dey for di north said of one smal wota for Porto Novo wey bi di kapital of Benin wey join bodi enta Legos for Naija. I com stil konet ples like Legos, Ilaro and Porto Novo together, an i shie boda wit Republic of Benin. Wen dem kount di pipu we live die for 2006, di nomba dat taim na 241,093. Badagry dey nie lagoon and ocean, dis one kom mek am bi di ples we plenti biznes hapun fo West Africa from 1736 to 1851, an bikos i get smal smal wota laik lakes we konet to the big wota, na im mek pipu com fit de bai and sel wel. For dat taim we dem dey bai an sel slev to oyinbo land, na di big sea wey dem dey call ocean wey dey Badagry be di rod wey konet di pipu wey dey buy an di pipu wey dey sel togeda." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Benin (Ripoblik of Benin) wey plenti pipu sabi as Republic of Benin, na Dahormey Dem dey kol am bifor, na kontri wey dey West Africa. E dey klose to Togo for west, an Naija to di east, Burkina Faso to di north West, Niger to di north east. Wia dia pipu dey live pas na for south for Bright of Benin, pat of Guinea wey dey north of di Atlantic Ocean. Dia kapita na Porto Novo, nd wia dia Government sidon na insaid Cotonu, wey bi wia pipu plenti pas for di kontri an na plez wey dem dey du market tins pas for di kontri. Benin kova 114,763 square kilometas (44,310 sq mi) an di pipu wey dey sta dia for 2021 rich 13 million. Na smol kontri. Wey d economi na ontop Agrikosho, dem dey kari red oil cotton go oda kontri go sel. Wok wey dem dey du pas na fam wok." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Benin City na di kapital an di largest city of Edo State for southern Naija. E com bí di fourth-largest city for Naija after Lagos, Kano and Ibadan, and e com get a total population of 1,782,000 as of 2021.[1]" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "DJ Kaywise stat im karier as rekod produsa na for leta e kon stat to dey du Disk Jockey. E stat in DJ wok for 2010. Na wen im rilis di mixtape \"Emergency\" na dat time pipul kon no am well well. E don rilis more dan 10,000 CD mixtape, over 50 online rilis mixtape an rilis meni muzik an visuals wit Nigerian an Afrika artist." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "DJ Kaywise du di maiden edishon of im strit konsat wey im kol \"The Joor Concert\" for 2016. For one interview e tok sey di fes four of di konsat get plenti pipul wey kom wey rish like 50,000(unverifiable). DJ Kaywise du di fifth edishon for January 2020. For Di past years now dem don dey du di Joor konsat for different Sitis for outside di kontri an e Don du two edishon for London an Dubai." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Na shi skore goal pas fo di 2014 FIFA U -20 Women's world cup an na shi bi di bes playa fo di tonament. Na shi bi di bes playa fo an sekond persin wey skore pas fo Supa Falcon teem who win di 2014 FiFA women's Afrika Championship." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Vicker stat wit radio presenta at Groove 106.3fm (1999 -2000) an Vibe 91.9fm (2001-2004) an still wok for Television station TV3 Ghana (1997 - 1999) & Metro TV (20000-2004), Van Vicker dey for one Ghanian televishon series Sun City, wey dey abaut Universiti life. Na im bi Le Roy King jr, for di fim." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Dem bon am for Leicester, Plumptre gro up an skul for Melton Mowbray. Shi stat to dey pley bol wen shi dey 4 years old. Na smol pikin of 4 years e bi wen e join Asfordby Amateurs. Web shi dey 8 years old, shi join Leicester City, shi uze seven years wit di klub an shi pley fom onda -10 to onda -15 levu for di klub. Shi komot for Leicester go join Birmingham City's onda -17 team in 2013. In 2014, Plumptre join third side FA Women's Premier League syd Derby county's." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "ScaleMajor = unit:year increment:100 start:-750" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "ScaleMinor = unit:year increment:25 start:-800" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "align:center textcolor:black fontsize:8 mark:(line, black) width:15 shift:(0,-5)" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "In tems of obital moshon, a Martian sola day (sol) dey equal to 24.5 hauas and a Martian sola year dey equal to 1.88 Earth years (687 Earth days). During a year, laj surfais temperashor dey swing for di surfais of Mars between -78.5C|F to 5.7C|F wey simila to Earth's seasons, as both planets get signifikant obital ecentriciti and axial tilt. Mars get tuw nachoral satelaits wey smol and dey iregula for shayp: Fobos and Deimos." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Di 2017 -18 PGA tour na di 103rd season of di PGA Tour, na di professional tour insaid United States. Na di 50th season sins dem komot am fom PGA of America di 12th edishon of di FedEx kop." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "E trein as seketari for Lagoon Secretarial College for Lagos an get diploma satifiket. Abimbola leta get satifiket for Koputa Sayensi fom University of Lagos." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Dem bon Isiaka Abiola Adeyemi Ajimobi for December 16, 1949 Insaid di Ajimobi famili of Ibadan for Oja-Iba, Ibadan. Isiaka Abiola Adeyemi Ajimobi stat e edukashion for Saint Patricks Primary School, Oke-Padre for Ibadan an e finish primari skul for Ibadan City Council Primary School, Aperin. E du e sekondri skul for Lagelu Grammar School." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Ajimobi waka go du univasiti edukashion for United States of America, wey e rid Business Administration and Finance for State University of New York, insaid Buffalo city for New York. E kolet" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Di university dey offer post graduate studies go reach doctorial level. D staff/students counseling centre, e-learning centre, students accommodation and sport facilities with oder available support services." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Adebayo Adedeji (Dem bon am for December 21 1930 an e dai for April 25, 2018) na Naija man wey rid abaut biznes an skul mata. E go skul wel wel an e don bi profeso wen im dey 36 years an dem mek am di oga kpata-kpata wey dey kontrol how dem fit dey mek Naijá beta an du beta beta tins for Naijá from 1971 go rish 1975. Na im kontrol how dem tek stat to dey mek Naijá beta again afta dem don fait war finish. For June 1975 dem mek Adeleke Adedeji one big oga for United Nations for insaid Afrika an e du dis one ontil July 1991. Na Adedeji rait one tin wey dem dey kol Lagos Plan of Action of 1980 an UN an OAU sopot di tin. Wen e kom bak to Naijá, e kom stat one tin wey dem dey kol African Centre for Development and Strategic Studies (ACDESS). No bi govment dey kontrol dis one an dem no dey yuz am mek moni an e opun am so dat pipul go kom dey yuz am len plenti tins abaut Afrika. Dem giv am one big post wey bi Commander of the Federal Republic." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Adelabu an e grup kom rili bi problem for di pipul wey dey di grup wey IPU an AG dey kontrol. E rili wahala dem wit di way im tek arenj di tax mata an di wok of di pipul wey dia famili dey rul (Mogajis) for gofment mata. E kom put imsef as pesin wey dey sopot di way dem dey rul dem an di tins bifo dem di oyinbo pipul kom tish dem dis niu sistem. Wen di taim rish for di pipul to selet wu di popul wey go lid dem for 1954, Adegoke kom win plenti of di posishon for di Ibadan District Council. Dis one kom mek Adegoke bi di oga kpata-kpata for dat aria. Im kon be di oga kpata-kpata for pipul wey dey kontrol moni an evri smol smol grup for dia. Wen di taim rish for pipul to chuz di pesin wey go dey rul dem for Naija for 1954, Adegoke kom win one posishon for House of Representatives an im grup sef dem win plenti-plenti post for di House of Representatives. E kom get one taim wey e kom bi di sekond oga for NCNC for Naija, dem kom stil mek am di oga kpata-kpata of pipul wey go dey giv Naija pipul all di beta-beta tin wey dem nid. E du dis one join di one wey e fest bi as di oga kpata-kpata for di Ibadan District Council fom January 1955 go rish January 1956." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Adekunle Almoruf Kosoko (dem bon am for January 28, 1987), wey pipul sabi as Adekunle Gold an AG Baby, na Naija Afrobeat singa an song raita. Pipul no am wel wen e rilis Sade song fo 2015, na hi-laif song. E du kontrat wit Olamide YBNL Adekunle Gold rilis e albom wey bi Gold for 2015, wey dey Nomba 7 for Billboard Wod albom shat. Bifor Gold albom, E don du 3 songs wey bi Sade, Orente an Pick Up. Adekunle Gold tel Naija Entertainment today sey, bifor im du kontrat wit YBNL, na im du disain for Olamide, Lil Kesh an Vitoh albom." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Afta Adekunle rilis Sade, E kon rilis e fest sinu wey bi Orente an na for YBNL rekod e rilis di song afta e don du Kontrat wit dem on March 5, 2015. Adekunle nem dey for singa wey fit win beta singa wey get beta futsho for City People Entertainment award 2015. On July 18, 2016, Adekunle Gold mek pipul no di songs wey dey insaid im album wey bi Gold. Di albom get 16 trak, beta produsa wey wok for di albom na Pheelz, Mastercraft, B Banks, Slekaamo, Oscar an Seyikeyz. Na July 25 dem rilis di albom. Wen e rilis di albom, di albom dey nomba 7 for Billboard Wold Albom shart fyo di week 13 August 2016. Adekunle Gold komot for YBNL Nation wen e kontrat finish, E kon go du niu band wey bi The 79th Element. On January 15, 2018, Unity Bank pik Adekunle Gold as dia ambassador. Adekunle Gold rilis 'Afro pop vol. 1' albom on August 21, 2020." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "River State dey for di southern part of Nigeria, and also for di eastern part Niger Delta and e expand reach di oceanward extension of Benue Trough. Wetin oyinbo call tropical rainforest plenty inside di state and for di area. River State get 11,077km² (4,277sq mi) as e total area and day one make am di 26th largest state for Nigeria. States like Imo, Abia and Anambra surround am from di north side, Bayelsa and Delta follow from di west side why Akwa Ibom sef join from east side. Atlantic Ocean na im take the southern part." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "The inland part of the state consists of tropical rainforest, and towards the coast, the typical Niger Delta environment features many mangrove swamps. Rivers State has a total area of 11,077 km² (4,277 sq mi), making it the 26th largest state in Nigeria. Surrounding states are Imo, Abia and Anambra to the north, Akwa Ibom to the east and Bayelsa, Delta to the west. On the south, it is bounded by the Atlantic Ocean. Its topography]ranges from flat plains, with a network of rivers to tributaries." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Zangon Kataf (Tyap: Nietcen-A̱fakan) na Lokal Govment Area for southern Kaduna Stet, Naijá. Di big ofis dey di town wey dem dey kol Zonkwa. Zangon Kataf na stil di nem of one town for di chiefdom of di Atyap pipul. Oda town-dem bi: Batadon (Madakiya), Chenkwon (Samaru Kataf), Kamantan an Kamuru. E get area wey big rish 2,579 km² an pipu wey plenti rish 318,991 for di 2006 census. Di postal kode of di area na 802." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Moshood Abiola National Stadium fit kolet 60,491 persin, dem kova am wit roof wey no too heavy. Di Stadium get two ples wey pipul wey dey wotch bol fit sit; Di wan wey dey low get 32,000 seats an di up kon get 28,000 seats. Di one wey dey low get 56 koporate ples wey persin fit dey wotch bol, di stadium kon stil get one ples difiren wey dey fo President or oda top pipul, na 50 persin di ples fit tek. All di ples wey dey fo Ceremony an oda tins floor na 25,000 m². Di ples fo pipul wey wan watch bol get one smol ples onda wey get diferen kiosk, banks, an toilet. Na concrete an situ dey uze du di stadium. Na 36 strong tol pole dey uze sopot di roof. Di tol tins wey hod am get 140 piles wit diameta of 1.30m an 1.50m." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Eastern Obolo (or Obolo agan̄ Mbum-ura for dem natif Obolo langwej) ma one Local Gorment Area (LGA) for southern Naija. En headquarters dey for Okoroete. The place dey for Akwa Ibom State, and na local gorment wey dey near oshen. Na on 4th December, 1996 wey Federal Gorment of Naija tok sai mek Eastern Obolo no dey share gorment with Ikot Abasi LGA again; mek en stand by en self. Na so dem take give am en own local gorment. People wey live there plenty pass 30,000, and de area big reach 17,000 km². En get 16 villages, wey dem divided into two clans, wey bi Okoroete and Iko. En get ten political wards. All di villages wey dey Eastern Obolo na of di Obolo ethnic group, and dem get common ancestral lineage wey dey make dem live together peacefully." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Usain St Leo Bolt (dem bon am on 21 August 1986) na Jamicain forma sprinter, wey plenti pipu sabi am as pesin wey dey run pas for di wod. E get Wod rekod in di 100 metres, 200 metres, an 4 × 100 metres relay. E get 8 Olympic gold medal. Na Bolt bi di onli spinster wey win Olympic 100 m an 200 m awod for 3 sem times Olympic (2008,2012, an 2016). E don win two 4 × 100 relay gold medals. Wetin mek plenti pipu sabi am na as e win dobu sprint in wod rekods times for di wod 2018 Beijing Olympics." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "75% of di Ni-Vanuatu populaeshon dey liv for rural ereas, wheras di remainin 25% of di populaeshon dey liv for oban ereas. Port Vila and Luganville bi di praimari oban citis wey dey populaeted wit Port Villa populaeshon of 35,901. Di total land erea bi 12,189&nbsp;km² wit a populaeshon grout rate of 1.67%. Kristianiti mek up di majoriti for di relijious komuniti as 93.5% of di populaeshon dey identifai as Kristians as of 2020." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Indonesia, (ɪndoˈnesia) wey ofishali bi di Repoblik of Indonesia, bi di ofishal nem wey dey in yuz pas, dou di nem Unitari Staet of di Repoblik of Indonesia (, NKRI) also dey apia for som ofishal dokuments.}} bi wan kontri for Sauteas Asia and Oceania bitwin di Indian and Pacifik ocean. E dey konsis of ova 17,000 ailands, inkludin Sumatra, Java, Sulawesi, and pats of Borneo and Niu Gini. Indonesia bi di lajes ailand kontri for di wold and di 14th-lajes kontri bai erea, at 1,904,569 km². Wit ova 279 milion pipo, Indonesia bi di foht-mos populous kontri for di wold and di mos populous Muslim-maejoriti kontri. Java, wey bi di mos populous ailand for di wold, bi hom to moh than haf of di populaeshon of di kontri." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "PlotArea = width:720 height:55 left:65 bottom:20" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Silver Bullet difren fom lead bullet for som ways. Lead get 10% high density pas silver. wey kon mek silver bullet no get pawa pas di one wey rezembu am. Pure silver dey less wit fors pas insaid lead an copper for strong (1.5 < 2.5 < 3.0 Mohs) an shear modulus (5.6 < 30 < 48 GPa). Silver Bullet dey uze riffle of gun barrel." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Adeleke na first Irish wuman wey go break di 50 sekonds rekod insaid di 400 meters. Shi get seven singu Irish rekods (60 m indoors, 100 m outdoors, 200 m indoors an out, 300 m indoors an 400 m indoors an out) as pat of relay teams, shi folo set rekod for two nashonal rekods: di women's 4 × 400 metres relay an di mixed 4 × 400 metres relay." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Na Erayokan kari fest for di 400 mitas ron wey hapun for di 18th Naija Nashonal Sport Festiva wey hapun in 2012. Abass Abubakar kari sekod an Gerald Odeka bi di nomba three pesin for dat kompetishon. Erayokan repriset Naija in di 2014 komon-wet Games an e ron di 4 × 400m. Erayokan don olso repiset Naija at di 2015 IAAF Wold Riley." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "In Da So Da Kauna 1&2, Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers Enterprises, Kano. 1991. and" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Hattara Dai Masoya 1 & 2, Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Masoyan Zamani&nbsp; 1& 2, Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers Enterprises, Kano. 1993 and" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Wani Hani Ga Allah 1 & 2, Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers Enterprises, Kano. 1994 and" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Malam Zalimu, (A Hausa play and winner 1st prize prestigious award of 2009 Engineer Mohammed Bashir Karaye Prize in Hausa Literature), Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers Enterprises,&nbsp; Kano. 2009" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Som tins wey e du as poplik savant na di supavishun of di Bureau of Public Enterprises (BPE) privatization projects. E still set up an bi di Board shairman of Legos Sekuriti Trost Fond. Na Sanwo-Olu set up di LAGBUS Sistem an di kontrol & kommand senta for Alausa Ikeja." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "One day after Valentine for 2013 Banky w launch im new album \"R&BW\" with concert tag wey be \"Grand love concert\" wey dem do for Civic centre Ozumba Mbadiwe Victoria Island Lagos Wey e feature plenty other artist including Iyanya and Waje. Di first two singles for di album wey be \"lowkey and Yes/No\"." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "John Lennon songwriter Award 2006 R&B category for \"My Regret\"." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Africa Ocean Lines bi di fest biziness wey Dokpesi fest do. Di kompini bi di fest shipin kompini wey Afrika pesin wan get in di hol of Afrika.Na for 1980s Dokpesi Start Africa Ocean Lines. Di biziness leta skata, but helep Naija shipin indostrie bikos e stat di law wey dey kontro shipin biziness as e dey Nigerian Shipping Act Decree 1986. An dis start di 40:20:20 for load wey dey kom from oyinbo land to Afrika land." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "For spring of 1968 dem use $7.5million to take complete di expansion of polo park. Dis addition bring three storey Eaton's department store to di mall wey make polo park di second largest shopping centre for Canada for that time." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Tony Umez na Naija actor. sinci umez akt for di fim Died wretched Buried in N2.3M casket for 1994, wey mek am popula an bikos of dis fim, i don akt for mo den 200 Nollywood fims of boat inglish an Yoruba languej dem" },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Sim Fabura sign N195.3bn kontrat wit Julius Berger mek dem tek du Port Harcourt Ring Road. Di govnor tok sey e don pay N150 billion fest for di wok." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Jupita bi di fifth planet from di Sun and di lajes for di Sola System. E bi a gas jaiant wit a mass wey dey moh than tuw and a haf taims dat of aul di oda planets for di Sola System kombaiynd, and slaihtli less than wan wan-tausandt di mass of di Sun. Jupita dey obit di Sun at a distans of 778.479Gm AU wit an obital period of 11.86u years. Jupita bi di thord braihtes nachoral objet]] for di nait skai of di Earth afta di Moon and Venus, and e don dey in obsavaeshon sins prehistorik taims. E get di simbol ." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "For 00:05 on 15 April, Kaptain Smith orda say mek di ship's laifboats dey unkovad and di pasenjas mustad. Bai nau, plenti pasenjas dey weik, havin notis say di enjins and dia akompaniyin vaibrashons don sodenli stop. Him also orda say mek di radio operators begin send distres kols, wey wrongli plaes di ship for di the wes side of di ice belt and dairet reskeuas to posishon wey dey inakuraet bai abaut 13.5nmi|mi km." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Mars bi di foht planet from di Sun. Di surfais of Mars bi orenj-red bikos na iron(III) oxide dust kova am, wey giv am di niknem \"di Red Planet\". Plenti enomos extint volkanos dey for Mars (such as Olympus Mons, 21.9km|mi tall) and wan of di lajes kanyons for di Sola System (Valles Marineris, 4000km|mi long). For komparisin, Mars's diameta bi 6779km. E dey klasifaid as a terrestrial planet and bi di sekond smoles of di planets of di Sola System. E get di simbol ." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Neptun bi di eiht planet wey fa pas from di Sun. E bi di foht-lajes planet for di Sola System bai diameta, di thord-mos-masiv planet, and di densest jaiant planet. E bi 17&nbsp;taims di mass of Earth, and dey slaihtli moh masiv than felo ice jaiant Uranus. Neptun dey densa and fisikali smola than Uranus bekaus e great mass dey kaus moh gravitashonal kompresion of e atmosfe. Wey dey komposd praimarili of gasis and liquids, e no get wel-defaind solid surfais. Di planet dey obit di Sun wons evri 164.8&nbsp;years for an orbital distans of 30.1AU|e9km e9mi. E nem kom from di Roman god of di sea and get di astronomikal simbol wey dey represent Neptun traident." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Two smol pikin wit long rope wey dey abaut 12 feet (3.7m) fom diasef go dey ton dey rope as oda smol pikin dey enta jomp di rope." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Bifor dey chuz am as di lyaloja of di Association of Nigerian market women and men, e don saf as tok tok lida of di maket women's association for Legos Stet." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "\"Adanma' wey some pipu dey spell 'Adamma' na also girl's name for Igboland in Naija and e mean di first beautiful daughter wey dey di family." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Adeleke na komuniti memba an pesin wey dey dash moni an propati wey enta politis for 2001 with e late broda Senator Isiaka Adeleke wey dai for April 2017. E kontest di Osun west 2017 senatorial by-election afta e broda dai an dey kom pik am onda di parti People's Democratic Party." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Adeniran Ogunsanya, QC, SAN (Dem bon am for January 31, 1918 an e dai for November 22, 1996) na Naija lorya an politishan. E join bodi fom Ibadan Pipul Parti (IPP). E saf as di oga kpata-kpata for pipul wey dey joj mata for kot an for skul mata for Legos Stet. For di sekond ripublik, im na di oga kpata-kpata for di Nigeria People's Party." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Adeniran na also Senior Advocate of Nigeria (SAN) an stil get one beta tin as lorya wey dem dey kol Queen's kounsel." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Adejumoke Aderounmu na Naija aktres wey grow up for Abeokuta, [[Ogun State|Ogun Stet], Naija, wie e go primari an sekondri edukeshon.Pipul sabi am for di rol wey e pla inside jenifa's dairy as Esther and kelechi inside di popula Nollywood TV siris. Shi akt with Jummy Adams in Nollywood's Box Office fim Alakada 2 alongside Funke Akindele, Toyin Abraham, Odunlade Adekola, Linda Ejiofor, Falz, Juliana Olayode, Omotunde Adebowale David (Lolo) and more." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Tolulope Adesua Etomi-Wellington wey pipul sabi as Adesua Etomi na Naijá aktres. Na for 2014 e du e fest fim wey bi Knocking on Heaven's Door.Etomi win di Best Actress for Drama awod for di 2016 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards for di e pat for di fim wey bi Falling for 2015." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Etomi du fim laik The Arbitration, The Wedding Party and Faling. Di way e tek du for di fim wey get di nemFalling mek am win 2016 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Award for Best Actress in Drama. Oda fim wey Etomi du na A Soldier's Story (2015), Out of Luck (2015) an Couple of Days (2016). For di fourth and fifth season of Shuga wey bi fim abaut how pipul fit prevent HIV/AIDS, Etomi akt as Shiela for di fim." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Na di Construction firm wey dem dey call Planet Projects Limited build the Oshodi Bus Terminal for total money wey dem estimate to be around $70 million. Dem build di bus terminal make e fit accommodate about 820 mass transit buses." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "For 1986 di mall go tru renovation wey cost $75 million wey give di building second level. Di downtown Winnipeg merchant no dey happy with di plan so dem carry di matter go city council go talk dia mind after di meeting for 1984 council still approve di expansion of di building even as dem no gree. Di expanded shopping centre open for mid- August 1986." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "A new $49 million expansion to polo park open for 1 October 2014 for di former Zellers space for di mall second level. Di redeveloped space include 114000 sq ft(10600m) of retail space and e create 17 new stores." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "One BBC Panorama investigation bin torchlight Adegboyega plus other leaders of the church sake of say dem dey take cunny cunny collect money from people wey dey come the church. Some members wey panorama interview bin talk say make dem torchlight the church and Adegboyega well well as him hand no clean on top this matter. Panorama come later release one video of Adegboyega where him bin talk say him no see anything wey wrong if church members dey drop at least £1,000 every month for the church sake of say him self dey target £1 million monthly." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Tobi Adegboyega be cousin to Oyinbo actor John Boyega. Him dey live inside one £2.5 million mansion for Surrey inside England. For one interview in 2002, him talk say him don marry for 8 years." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Di money wey dey don yuz maintain d stadium sinc di time dey don du am don reech $7 millon, wey plenti pipul don tok sey e too much fo maintenance. Bikos of di plenti moni fo maintenance Federal Govment of Nigeria kon dside to find private compani wey go dey manaj am." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Dem bon am for Naijà, Osimhen stet im sinior Karier fo Germany at VfL Wolfsburg in 2007. Afta one season an half fo di klob, e kon go Belgian side Charleloi fo loan in 2018-19, bifor e kon go France at Lille. In 2020, Osimhen transfer to Seria A klob Napoli fo a klob rekod fee of £70 million. Na im win di Seria A Bes young playa awod in di 2021-22 season." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "On 31 July 2020, Seria A klob Napoli anous sey dey don sign Osimhen, fo klob rekod of £70 million wit add-on wey mek di moni dey lik £80 million, wey kon mek am dey insaid playa wey cos pas fo Afrika." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Erastus Akingbola don du koret kontribushion to pipul an e don also yuz e Organisashion wey e head tek hep pipul tu to hep mek buildin insaid Hiya institushions for Naijá. Na one of dis kontribushion bi di 120-Bed, 60 Room Post Graduate Hostel wey e build an put beds for University of Lagos in 2006. Intercontinental Bank, wen e bin dey in charge, also build and donate Hostel komplex plus oda buildin to meni Univasiti all ova Naijá, inkludin di University of Lagos, University of Benin, Bayero University, Kano etc." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Chief Hannah Idowu Dideolu Awolowo (November 25, 1915-September 19, 2015) wey pipul no wel wel as HID na Naijá bizness wuman an politishian.Dey stil no am as Adelana." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "2021-Present:Wondaland an Little (Love I Love)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Professor John Olubi Sodipo, (November 1982-December 1990)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Professor T. O Bamkole, (January 1991-March 1995)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Professor O. Y Oyeneye, April 1995-November 1999" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Professor Layi Ogunkoya, November 1999-March 2001" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Professor Afolabi Soyode, April 2001-Jan 2006" }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Innocent Ujah Idibia (dem bon am for 18 September 1975), wey pipul no wel wel as 2baba, na Naija singa, song-raita an podusa an im sabi dash pipul moni an gift wel wel.",
        "Dem bon am April 6 1965, for Ibadan, wey bi kapita of Oyo Stet, southwest Naija.",
        "Adelabu an e grup kom rili bi problem for di pipul wey dey di grup wey IPU an AG dey kontrol. E rili wahala dem wit di way im tek arenj di tax mata an di wok of di pipul wey dia famili dey rul (Mogajis) for gofment mata. E kom put imsef as pesin wey dey sopot di way dem dey rul dem an di tins bifo dem di oyinbo pipul kom tish dem dis niu sistem. Wen di taim rish for di pipul to selet wu di popul wey go lid dem for 1954, Adegoke kom win plenti of di posishon for di Ibadan District Council. Dis one kom mek Adegoke bi di oga kpata-kpata for dat aria. Im kon be di oga kpata-kpata for pipul wey dey kontrol moni an evri smol smol grup for dia. Wen di taim rish for pipul to chuz di pesin wey go dey rul dem for Naija for 1954, Adegoke kom win one posishon for House of Representatives an im grup sef dem win plenti-plenti post for di House of Representatives. E kom get one taim wey e kom bi di sekond oga for NCNC for Naija, dem kom stil mek am di oga kpata-kpata of pipul wey go dey giv Naija pipul all di beta-beta tin wey dem nid. E du dis one join di one wey e fest bi as di oga kpata-kpata for di Ibadan District Council fom January 1955 go rish January 1956.",
        "Hattara Dai Masoya 1 & 2, Published by Gidan Dabino Publishers",
        "National Youth Service Corps Orientation Camp wey dem no go change dey for Iyana-Ipaja Road for Agege.",
        "Akpan Okon na di last Obong of Ibom Kindom araund 1690-1720. Na im broda wey bi Akakpokpo Okon ovatrow am wit di hep of som grup wey bi Eze Agwu, Nnachi Ipia, an di Nnubi Dynasty for di war wey dem dey kol Aro-Ibibio War. As dem kommot am as king na im mek dem stat a niu kindom wey dem dey kol Arochukwu Kingdom.",
        "Masari kolet tiket wan bi govno of Katsina Stet for di 2011 eleshion onda Congress for Progressive Change (CPC) parti bot e no win di eleshon an na PDP kandidet wey bi Ibrahim Shehu Shema win am.",
        "Fo June 8 2015, Oshoala skore im fes 2015 FIFA Wumen's Wod kop goal, wen shi skore di sekond teem goal fo 3-3 draw wit Sweden insaid winnipeg. Oshaola dey amog di Supa Falcon teem wey win Afrika wumen championship fo 2016 an 2018. Shi skore three gaols fo di 2018 kup,wey dem play fo Ghana. Na Oshaola bi di sekond captain fo Supa falcon teem, fo di 2019 FIFA wumen's wod kop fo France. Na Oshaola skore fo di sekond match wey dey tek win South Korea 2-0. Na shi dem giv bes playa of di match. FIFA kol Oshaola nem fo insaid playa wey skore bes goal fo di Competition. Wit Oshaola di teem finish fo third fo grup A. Germany an Naijà play fo d nex stag,dem win Nigeria 3-0 fo di match.",
        "Badagry gain from di fait ontop slave bizness we hapun between Porto Novo an Dahomey fo di end of Eighteenth Century. Bikos if fait hapun ontop any slave dat taim, na Badagry dem dey sel di slave come for chep pris.",
        "For 1600, Benin wey dey todey get difren stai of politis an plenti tribe. Plez dey wey klose to water (Aja pipu, Yoruba an Gbe langwej pipu) an plez wey no klose to water (wey Bariba, Mahi, Gedevi, an Kabye pipu dey sta). Di Oyo Empire, wey dey east of Benin, na dem get solja pas, na dem dey kolet tins fom pipu of eni tribe. But tins chenj for 17th an 18th centuri as di Kingdom of Dahormey, wey get plenti Fon pipu, dey sta for Abomey an stat to dey kontrol wia pipu wey dey for water side dey sta. By 1727, king Agaja of di Kingdom of Dahormey, don dey kontrol Allada an Whydah. Dahormey don kon dey bi di sekond of Oyo Empire, but dem no faight pipu wey dey klose to Oyo for Porto-Novo. As Darhomey dey get pawa, an bi dey wan stil get pawa lik Oyo Empire, dey til wen an bifor Oyibo pipu kon dey kontrol dem.",
        "BOGA (wey pipul no as Boka) nah Afro-Asiatic languaj wey dem dey spik for Adamawa Stet of Nigeria.",
        "Alhaji Abdulsalam sanyaolu stat e aktin maria for 1953 an na for inside shosh for legos e stat di aktin wok.",
        "as dem see am for nuz again for April 21 2019, Stober ritaya from Nigerian Broadcasting Authority. Cyril Stober stil dey do regula program for NTA netwok afta im retirement as e don bekom big pesin for Naija.",
        "For 29 of May 2019, dey give am pawa to bi di Gofnor of Ogun Stet.",
        "Temple Foundation Endowed Professorship, UT-Austin 2020–Present",
        "Bikos of how e tek akt wel wel inside Behind Closed Door, e nem enta di katigori for Best Aktor in a Soportin role at di Afrika Muviee Akedemi Awod in 2006.",
        "bi di bifor bifor Presidor of di Nigerian Academy of Engineering. Im bi fellow of di Nigerian Society of Engineers, na im bi di forma Presidor of di Association of Consulting Engineers Nigeria, fellow Nigerian Institute of Management an fellow International Institute of Director. Im bi memba of American Society of Civil Engineers an di Association of African Development Experts.",
        "By di taim wen dey du dia baday, Esther no fit waka norma again an na chair wey dey dem push e dey yuz.Esther an Emily dey bai an sell tins.Emily mari Hubert Ogunde one Aktor wey popula for Naijá.Pipul wey kom fom dia famili dey liv long bikos dia mama sef dai wen shi bi 104 years old.Esther an Emily tok sey dey liv long bikos dem no dey drink or smoke bot sey na dia belif in God dey hep dem.Na for September 2013 Emily dai an e get one boi.Emily get plenti grand pikin dem for oda famili, Esther kom dai for 2018.",
        "Femi Adebayo Salami (dem bon am for December 31, 1978) na Naijá akto, dareto, lorya an speshal advaisa on Arts an Kulture.mata to di Gofnor of Kwara Stet.E stil dey advais di Gofnor on pipul wey dey traful for Kwara Stet.",
        "Afta e sekondiri skul, Oyetola go rid Insurance for Unilag ( University of Lagos) an kolet Bachelor of Science satifikat (Bsc) in 1978. Na for Potiskum, Yobe Stet Oyetola tekbdu e Youth Korpa(NYSC), an na ticha wok for Staff Training Centre e du fom 1978 to 1979.",
        "Claudiana Ibijoke Sanwo-Olu (dem bon am for January 8, 1967) na Naija wuman wey bi First Ladi of Lagos State an waif of Babajide Sanwo-Olu.",
        "Di ikeja citi mol dem stat to dey biud am for May 2010 an dem bi won mek i opun for tradin November 2011. Bot i no wok aut like dat so dem kom finalli open am for lat December. One of di tin we diley di wok bi sey smol pat of di biudin fol wey bi sey i wund five pipu wel wel an dis wan hapun for Thursday 9 December 2010.",
        "For 100 years now, dis podut don dey sel wel wel for evriwia for Naijá, for Benin Republic, Cameroon, Ghana an som pat of Europe. For now, na one of di grand pikin of Chief Jacob Odulate wey e nem bí Koye Odulate dey manej di kompini.",
        "Di 2017 City People Movie Awards see Odetola get nominashon for best suportin actress (Yoruba).",
        "Dey bon Ken Erics on February 28, 1985 for Kano Stet.E bi di six pikin inside di seven Pikin-dem wey e papa an mama bon.E papa na Eric Chukwuemeka Nwenweh an e mama na Grace Ifeyinwa Nwenweh an bot of dem na kom fom Enugwu-Ukwu for Anambra Stet, Southeast Naijá. Erin na Igbo. Erics du e primari edukashion for Binta Mustapha Science Nursery and Primary School, Kano, an e secondiri edukashion for Dennis Memorial Grammar School (DMGS) Onitsha, Anambra Stet. Na from smol pikin Eric don like akt.Erics sho passion for aktin an na dis one mek am go rid Theatre Arts for Nnamdi Azikiwe University Awka, Anambra Stet. E stil get mastw digri for Theatre and Film Studies.",
        "ambassaador for Airtel an Numatville Megasiti.",
        "Okujaye don dey akt for staj years ago bifor e join Nollywood.E tok sey na Amstel Malta Box Office TV sho wey e folo du rili hep e karia wel wel bikos di tin opun way for e fest Nollywood fim Alero's Symphony.",
        "For 2001, for one ōdishun for kalaba, Mbong mit Jeta Amata. Afta two yies wen shi bikom 18yie, dem stat rileshunship. For 2008, dem mari an get one gel wey ha nem bi Veno. For 2013, de sepiret an daivos for 2014.",
        "Muhammadu Buhari ( dem bon am 17 December 1942 an e kpai 13 July 2025) na Naija politishan wey dem elekt Presido for 2015. E na Muslim.",
        "Construction of The National Theatre start during the military regime of General Yakubu Gowon and complete during the military regime of Olusegun Obasanjo. For the year 2021, different people done manage this Edifice, some of then na, Jimmy Folorunso Atte (1991 – August 1999), Prof Babafemi A. Osofisan (2000 – 2004), Dr. Ahmed Parker Yerima (2006 – Aug 2009), Kabir Yusuf (2009 – 2016), George Ufot, (Late) Dr. (Mrs.) Stella Oyedepo, Professor Sunday Enessi Ododo, fsonta, FNAL.",
        "Obafemi Lasode (bon 4 December 1955 don 25 July 2025) na",
        "Afta Osim and Akuma Nnubi of Akuma don rul for smol time, Oke Nnachi kon bikom king for Arochukwu. Na e pikin-dem still dey rul for there til todey.",
        "E taitu na Ogiame Atogbuwa. E Portuguese nem na Manuel Octobia. Wen e dai, Olu Erejuwa I bekom king for im ples for 1760.",
        "Lay stat im karier wit rap group, im nem na \"Lil King\" for di grup. E com leta dey writ song an dey produs musik. E rilis \"Do not Disturb\" in April 2019. E rilis \"Hello Brother\" afta one month wey e don rilis di first song.",
        "Owanari Duke na Naijá lorya wey bi di waif of Donald Duke. Owanari bi di oga of di bodi of Dizengoff Nigeria.",
        "Peter Obi kontest for Anambra Stet gofnor eleshion as kandidet for the All Progressives Grand Alliance (APGA) parti for 2003, bot e oponet, Chris Ngige of di People's Democratic Party, (PDP) na e di Independent National Electoral Commission (INEC) diklai as winna.",
        "Ramsey Nouah (dem bon Ramsey Tokunbo Nouah Jr December 19, 1970) im bi Naija aktor an director. E win di Africa movie Academy Award for Best akto for lidin rol for 2010 for di pafomance for do muvi \"The Figurine\" e mek im directorial debut wit do fim \"living in Bondage Breaking free\" for 2019 an e stil go dairet Nollywood classic Rattlesnake The Ahanna Story which is a rimek of Rattlesnake (1995).",
        "Immediately afta leaving office in 2017, I go Mainframe Media and fim wey Tunde Kelani get for Abeokuta, Naija and dem train am as a fim",
        "2019 The Obituary of Tunde Johnson Adesola Johnson",
        "For year 2014, Makinde make up him mind to fight for Oyo State 2015 governorship ticket on top the platform of the People's Democratic Party (PDP) but for December 2014 when dem finish party's primary election,dem no gree give am the governorship nomination ticket. Na this mata plus to achieve his ambition make Oluseyi makinde waka comot for People's Democratic Party PDP) go join Social Democratic Party (SDP), where him contest for governor of Oyo State in year 2015.",
        "Soil na di mixture of organic matter, gases, liquids, minerals and organisms wey support life. Di soil wey on top earth get four functions:",
        "Ngozi Sylvia Oluchi Ezeokafor (Na July 7 dey bon am) wey pipu no wel wel as Sylvia Oluchy na Naijá aktres. Slyvia win di most promising akto of di year awod for di Best of Nollywood Awards.E post im foto of wen e no kova im bodi finish. Slyvia tok for one intaview wit Showtime Celebrity sey e no see enitin bad if pesin go half naked.",
        "Dem bon Initimi Timaya Odon for 15 August, 1980 for Port Harcourt, Rivers State. No im bi di fifteen pikin for Agip Estate, Port Harcourt. im papa dey wok for bank an im Mama dey seltins. Odon go Assemblies of God Nursery and Primary Skul. E kon leta go Nkpolu Oroworukwo for Port Harcourt. E dey komot fo haus for nait to go music sho. Timaya mama kon kari am komot fo Portharcourt, mek e folo im broda, mek e fo finish skul. Na fo Legos e kon tek finish sekondary skul, Ikeja Grammar School fo Legos na im bi di skul.",
        "Tyap langwej na one of di plenti langwej wey di pipul wey dey tok-am dey hia diasef an di langwej bi one of di Plateau langwej-dem of Naijá for Middle-Belt. Dey sabi di langwej wit di Hausa nem Katab abi Kataf. 5] Tyab langwej stil get meni nem wey dey tek no am dependin of di wey pesin dey spik am.For ezampul: Sholyio (Morwa), Fantswam (Kafanchan), Gworok (Kagoro), Takad (Attakar), \"Mabatado\" (Tyap 'proper'), Tyeca̱rak (Kacecere) an Tyuku (Tuku).As Blench(2008) tek tok am, e bi like sey one langwej wey bi Jju—wey get pipul wey dey tok-am wey plenti pas—na anoda type of Tyap (even as e tek bi sey di pipul wey dey tok di langwej dey see diasef like difren pipul). Na di pipul wey dey tok dis langwej dey kol am Atyap.",
