        "Uti reprisent Naija for Big Brother Africa 3. Na e bi di nomba 3 pesin wey dem rimuv for di Big Brother Africa 3 house for October 5, 2008 (Day42). For insaid di house pipul sabi Uti as pesin wey dey distob di oda housemates (pupil laik Mimi an Thami) During Namibian housmate Lucille's evicshon Uti vex as e kom no sey dem komot Lucille for di Big Brother house. For 2010, e folo for di Big Brother Africa 5 All stars wey bi say e last for 91 days an na im win di Big Brother as e beat Munya Chidzonga for di final vote of 8 to 7. Uti don stay for 133 days of di yuz for di Big Brother house .Pupi don sabi uti since wey e don dey host for di red carpet an TV progrram small group wey dem call dem salf gigs kom host kom put red carpet award as di biggest event for Africa. Di Africa Magic Viewers Chioce Awards,don dey an e stil dey count.he stil get oda show like magazine Jara show wey donlast for 11 season for Africa Magic FOR 2022 He host di red carpet of eighth edishon of Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards (AMVCA) di reunion of showmax kom hit TV show \"The RealHousewives of lagos an do launch evevt of tecno carmon19",
        "Na for die e start di journal Cameroon Voice in 1955. Afta, e do one play wey di taitu na I Am Vindicated, e still rait one buk wey di taitu na Adventuring with Jaja.",
        "For 1975, Dem select Borishade to train for di Nuclear and Power Engineering Station for Texas A&M University. Im kolet certificate for Nuclear Power Development. Im still go du more training for di International Atomic Energy Agency, Vienna for 1982. Borishade na registered engineer and a memba of di Institute of Electrical Engineers, United Kingdom.Im bi bifor bifor memba of di Nigerian Society of Engineers, American Nuclear Society, and di Science Association of Nigeria. Im bikom Associate Professor of Electrical Engineering for OAU in 1985.Im serve as a memba of di Technical Advisory Committee of di Regional Centre for Training in Aerospace Survey. Im bi representative of di congregation for di University Senate, and also Chairman of Project Advisory Committee and University Works and Maintenance Service Monitoring Committee.",
        "For one buk wey Richard F.Burton rait about Yoruba in 1861.E tok na fom di wod Ori Obba dey tek fom di wod Yoruba. Ori Obba minin for yoruba langwej na Head King.Di wod Ori Obba don dey wey pipul don dey tok an rait am sins 1500s.",
