        "Barbara Benary (dem bon am for April 7, 1946 an e kpai for March 17, 2019) na Amerika komposa an pesin wey dey stodi hiw difren difren kolshor dey mek muzik. Na muzik wey kom Indonesian an Indian e dey chuk eyes pass.",
        "Simpson, Jacqueline (2015-05-04). \"Sir Terry Pratchett OBE (1948–2015)\". Folklore. 126 (2): 232–234. doi:10.1080/0015587X.2015.1042722. ISSN 0015-587X.",
        "dey bon Erdenechimeg in 1957.Erdenechimeg kom from di famili wey like to stodi langwej an rekod how pipul dey du tins for lokal way. Erdenechimeg risach wok na stodi on old Asian muzik histri. Erdenechimeg bi visiti professor at di Indiana Yunivasiti, Dipatmet of Sentral Eurasian Stodies from 2005 go rish 2008.",
        "Allison Balfour or Margret Balfour na one of di wuman wey dey joj e kase sey e na witch in 1594 for Scotland. Na for Orkney Hiland of Scotland wey dey aria of Stenness Balfour dey stey. For dat time for Scotland, di Scottish Witchcraft Art 1563 tok sey eni bodi wey dey katch as Witch go kpai.",
        "Araund dat time,shi Mari e sekond hosband an shi kolet British Paspot so dat dem no go posh am komot from US bikos of di Trade Unino wok wey shi dey do.Dem kom skata do marej for 1961.",
        "In 1925, Sidney enta \"École Normale de Musique\" wey dey Paris to rid piano wit Alfred Cortot.",
        "Pipul stil hakuss am sey na e kill e forma hosband. Dey tok sey e du am by di transfa of di labor pain wey one wuman give am.Anoda tin wey dey tek hakuss am bi sey e no grit one man way grit am bak one day an di man kpai dat sem day. Dey sey Bane na witch bikos e go luk go majik way happun for sea side an sey how e tek no sey one pikin go bi boy or gel.",
        "For January 2023, Portable kritisized Johnson Suleman becos of im convoy atak for one of im songs. Dem also kritisized am for im \"public declarations\" wey konsan public polisis for Naija.",
        "Wen Roberts dey smol, e peter buy piano for am an dey hep am so dat e go sabi play di piano wel wel. Wen e finish e pamari an sekondri edukeshon in Monticello Seminari, Roberts go kontiniu e edukeshon from Chikago Musikal Kolej an e finish in 1909 an e stil finish Amerika konsavetori of Muzik in 1911.",
        "Di fest tishin wok wey Stekert du na for Wayne State Yunivasiti wey de Detroit. For di yunivasiti, Stekert kontiniu di wok wey Thelma G. James fest stat. Di wok bi see e kontiniu to dey kolet an kip di tradishonal ways pipul dey du tins for siti.",
        "E pley for Shooting Stars F.C. most of im kariha, and na im bi di gokipa wen Shooting Stars win Naija fes kontineta trofhi, di Afrikan Kup Winnas Kup for 1976.",
        "E papa na biznezman wey pipul respet wel-wel.E papa get plenti boat wey dem tek dey kol fish an na e biud AtholStreet for Peel.",
        "In Sweden, Rosenberg don join bodi wit di komposa Karin Rehnqvist an du meni wey Rosenberg do like: \"Puksänger-Lockrop\" (1989), \"Hrtluft\" (1993), \"Rädda mig ur dyn\" (1997), \"Sä gär en dag\" (2000). Rosenberg don also join bodi wit some daretor like Peter Oskarsson ( Den Agora Vreden, 1988-1990) an Leif Stinnerborn (\"Ljuset\" 1996).",
        "Victor Ejuvwevwo Arikoro, Naija akbishop",
        "If hot breeze dey enta ocean more more, e dey give heavi breeze wey dem dey kol \"cyclones\" more pawa. Dis heavi breeze an di oda ones wey dey skata tins go dey plenti more more bikos of klimet chenj. Di fud wey fish wey de nia on top ocean no go si fud chop again bikos na di more ocean kolet \"carbon\" for bodi, na di more fish go get fud to chop. As ocean tempurashon dey hot more more na so di levu of salt inside wota go inkres an na so smol wota like riva go dey get smol smol salt.",
        "Na Mamane fom di kompini Jacigreen an e rejista di kompini in Ouagadougou.",
        "Scelles-Millie's Contes sahariens du Souf, (1964) e rait dis lokal buk bai won Arab pesin wey dey tell stori from di Kabylie for di Sahara bohda. Som of di stori na for small pikin dem an e reelet am to di yut wey dey di aj of 15 an 16. Note dem, koment dem wit som wohd dem wey get esplaneshon dey insaid di stori.",
        "Ambrose Folorunsho Alli : Professor of medicine, Governor of Bendel State and the founder of Bendel State University, later posthumously renamed Ambrose Alli University.",
        "Di 2012 ripot wey Fud an Agrikolsho Hoganiseshon give mek am show sey e go hard dem to fit kari dia plan wey dey get to pipul bikos of how to get wota dey hard more more. Dis one na bikos sey agrikolsho an oda tins wey pipul dey du don mek wota for riva dry wel wel.",
        "Fo 2011, di join bodi wey bi Forbes estimet tins wey e get sey e rish US$3–10 million.",
        "Otti don go meni intanashonal korse wey inklud: \"Executive Development Programmes of the Columbia Business\", Stanford Business School\", an Wharton Business School ([[University of Pennsylvania|Yunivasiti of Pennsylvania).",
        "For som ples, pipo dey do difren tins to honor or respet pipo wen do kpai. Som pipo dey do parti, oda pipo dey put faya for dia dead bodi, an odas dey kari di dead bodi go montain an liv di dead bodi for di montain.",
        "Male artiste of di year for Africa Gospel Awards (AGAFEST) – 2019",
        "William Folorunso Kumuyi (wey dem bon for 6 June 1941) na Naija pastor wey bi di Fonda an general presidet of Dipa Kristen Life Bible Ministri wey de Gbagada, Legos Stet. Kumuyi don rait meni kristen buks. Na on 6 June 2021 Kumuyi do e 80 years birthday.",
        "Finidi dey pat of di playa wey plai for Naija futbol tim an e plai in two Wold kup. Wen Finidi dey plai for Naija, e dey put on jersi nomba 7.",
        "Abiola kpai for di mitin wey e dey do with Amerika ambasedor Thomas Pickering an Susan Rice for govamet guest house in Abuja. Na Rice give Abiola tea wey e drink bifor e kpai for dat mitin.",
        "On 26 November 2022, Enugu State University of Technology give am Honorari Doctorate.",
        "Sean Tizzle don sing for meni popular sho an event. Some of dem na:",
        "Na for 10 January 2015 Iheanacho join Manchester Siti Akademi. Bifor di 2014-2015 sisin, Man Siti go do Pre-Sisin for United State an Iheanacho folo dem go. Iheanacho put one goal inside net against Sporting Kansa City as Man Siti win do game 4-1. Iheanacho goal for di 5-1 wey Man Siti tek win AC Milan.",
        "For 2013, di produsa of Rubbin Minds pik Ebuka as di pesin wey go bi di niu host.",
        "Ambode enta ofis as govno of Legos on 29 May 2015. E tek ova from Babatunde Fashola. For October 2018, Ambode no win di Pamari eleshon wey APC do to chuz pesin wey dem wan mek e go as govno for di komin eleshon. Na Babajide Sanwo-Olu di parti pik as dia kandidet for di eleshon. E no get opshon Dan to sopot Sanwo-Olu.",
        "Francis Agoda (dem bon am on April 4, 1979), plenti pipu sabi am for im wok as I Go Dye na Naija pesin wey dey mek pipu laff. E bi raita, e dey tok to advais pipu. E don du plenti sho for Naija lik \"I Go Dye Standing\".",
        "For 7 August 2021, Madueke score two goal in di 4-0 will against Ajax. Na Ajax nomba 18 game wey dey neva loss onti PSV win dem. Madueke sahin anoda kontact win PSV onti 2025. PSV give Madueke jersi nomba 10.",
        "In November 2020, na im dey front for insaid pipu wey wan trai kari Im papa parti - Movement if the people - e wan regista am onda Naija electoral bodi, INEC.",
        "Quadr Akinade Aruna (dem bon on 9 August 1988, in Oyo Nigeria) na Naija ogbonge table tennis playa. E dey insaid 2012 Summer Olympics 2016 Summer Olympics, an 2020 Summer Olympics, e rish quarter-finals in 2016.",
        "Na wen Ige wan kolet niu posishon for United Nations International Law Commission dem kil am wit gun for Ibadan, wey bi Oyo State capita.",
        "Ajax beg UEFA about di ban as Onana do mistek about di medisin. UEFA kom ridus am from 12 month to 9 month in June 2021.",
        "Dem bon am in Sanlúcar la Mayor, Seville, Andalusia, Carlos Álvarez Rivera na fom Sevilla FC youth e finish. On 21 December 2022, e skore for im fest match wit sinior teem, na insaid Copa del Rey match wen dem win Juventud Torremolinos 3 - 0. E fest pley for La Liga on 8 January 2023, wen e enta for Òliver Torres insaid 2 - 1 home win wit Gatefe CF.",
        "Na Laycon bi di nomba 19 pesin wey enta di Big Broda Naija Sisin 5 on 19 July 2020. Pipo like am no bi smol. Laycon bikom di fest pesin wey go get 1 million folowas on Instagram wen e stil dey inside di buildin on 19 September 2020.",
        "Bazoum bi di fest memba of smol Arabs tribe Ouled Slimane Pipo wey bikom di presidet of Niger.",
        "Di official Liberland website says di kontri na created on top no-man's land (terra nullius) dat emerged bicos Croatia and Serbia don no bi agreed on top normal borders for ova 25 years. Dis border dispute includes some areas go di east for di danube which are claimed by both serbia and croatia. Croatia considers some areas for di west area for di river, de include Liberland, be part for Serbia, although Serbia no longer claims dat land",
