        "Ilushi na dey community in Esan South East Local Government Area of Edo State, Nigeria. A major river supports economic activities in the region.",
        "Kumo na di siti and di hed-kwuta of Akko loka govamet wey de Gombe Stet. Gombe Stet na one of di 36 stet in Naija. Di lokeshon of Gombe na norta-easta part of Naija. Kumo na di nomba two biznesss senta for Gombe Stet. Kumo de A345 along di hi-way road 40&n bsp;km for south of Gombe. Pipo dey go Kumo if Dem wan sell or buy Vejitebu, gra-not, kotin, korn, an milet. Anoda tins Dem wey pesin fit buy for Kumo na kasava Cowpeas,the Fulani, Tangale, and Hausa peoples of shipthe surrounding area.The secondary highway between Gombe and Yola serves the town.",
        "Perpetua an Felicity (for Latin langwej: Perpetua et Felicitas) dem bi two Kristen wey kpai bikos of dia faith for 3rd Senturi. Vibia Perpetua dat time jos mari an e na wuman wey go skul wel wel. By di time wey pipo kil am, Vibia Perpetua na 22 year old an e boi pikin de im hand wey e dey tekia",
        "One year afta di dai of e fes waif, again e mari anoda wuman kol Sarah wey bin kom from Plateau Stet, for e chorch for Saturday, July 10, 2021.",
        "2. Despite being declared wanted by EFCC, former Accountant-General wins PDP governor primary. Premium Times, 26 May 2022. Retrived 12 December 2022.",
        "The Gambia na kontri wey dem dey kol Republic of Gambia. Dem stil sabi di kontri as Gambia. Na kontri wey dey West Africa. Na Senegal sorand am. Na im bi di kontri wey smal pas for mainland Africa. Na Banjul bi di kapita citi. Di city dem wey big pas na Serekunda and Brikama.",
        "non-human communication systems in nature such as whale and other marine mammal vocalizations or honey bees' waggle dance.",
        "In the 4th century BC, Rome done come under attack by the Gauls, who now extend their power for the Italian peninsula beyond the Po Valley and through Etruria. On 16 July 390&nbsp;BC, a Gallic army under the leadership of tribal chieftain Brennus, defeat the Romans for the Battle of the Allia and march enter Rome. The Gauls loot and burn the city, then lay siege to the Capitoline Hill, where some Romans been barricade themselves, for seven months. The Gauls then agree to give the Romans peace in exchange for 1000 pounds of gold. According to later legend, the Roman when de supervise the weighing notice say the Gauls de use false scales. The Romans then take up arms and defeat the Gauls. Their victorious general Camillus remark \"With iron, no be with gold, Rome done buy her freedom.\"",
        "Forma presidor Muhammadu Buhari on October 2022 giv Ariwoola di GCON (Grand Commander of th",
        "Akording to kalkulashions, Di kurrent komuvin distans to partikuls from which the kosmic mikrowave background radiashion (KMBR) was emitted, which represents di radius of di visibul univas, be about 14.0 billion parsecs (about 45.7 billion laight-years). Di komuvin distans to the edj of the observabul univas bi about 14.3 billion parsecs (about 46.6 billion laight-years), about 2% larjer. Di radius of di obsavabul univas is therefore estimated to be about 46.5 billion laight-years. Using the critical density and di diameta of di obsavabul univas, di total mass of ordinary mata in di univas can bi calculated to bi abaut . In November 2018, astronomers reported that extragalactic background light (EBL) amounted to photons.",
        "Rossiya, wan Imperial Rossian ship of di line wey dem lonch for 1839",
        "Habib Okikiola (dem bon am on 12 March 1994) Wey plenti pipu sabi as Portable abi Dr Zeh na Naija singa, rappa an song raita.",
        "Na fom Kogi Stet, but dem bon am for Katsina to Naija lecturers, wia e tek gro as Christian bifor im famili kom Legos Stet. E stodi Graphic arts for Universiti of Lagos. Leta e kon go UK to get digre for Graphic design fom Kingsland Universiti of London.",
        "Na Hausa Kwotas dem dey kol wan of di strits for Igbudu Maket.",
