        "Indonesia bi a presidenshal repoblik wit elected lejislaechor. E get 38 provins, of which nain get speshal autonomous status. Di kontri kapital, Jakarta, bi di sekond-mos populous oban erea. Indonesia dey shia land bodas wit Papua Niu Gini, Eas Timor, and di eastan pat of Malaysia, as well as maritaim bodas wit Singapo, Vietnam, Tailand, di Filippins, Austrelia, Palau, and India. Despait e laj populaeshon and densli populaeted rejions, Indonesia get vast erea of wildanes wit di sekond-haies levul of baiodaivasiti for di wold afta Brazil.",
        "For midu age, ghost tori na abaut spirit wey no rest, wey no ci peace for aftalaif. Dia bliv bi sey this spirit na pipu wey dem du bad for wen dem dey dis laif or dem kpai in a bad way. Dem dey uze dis tori tich pipu lesson, wit ghost stan as wornin for pipu wey wan du bad an di risot for sin.",
        "Niu niu raita of buk like Idries Shah an Anthony de Mello don work wel wel so dat pipo wey no sabi Sufi tradishon go fit sabi dos parable.",
        "Wen dem get di snake, no bi di mit of di snake dem want but na di poisin wey e get.",
        "Akume get bachelor's digre insaid sociology an a masta digre insaid Labour Relation fom di Universiti of Ibadan. E dey sta for insaid Abuja, Nigeria.",
        "Foluke Daramola-Salako na Naija aktres. Shi dey insaid aktres wey dem rait im nem to kolet Afrika muvie Akademik awod for Best Aktres in a sopotin rol in 2013. Na Yoruba Naija aktres an shi dey produs fim.",
