        "Onda di konstitushononstitution of 1979 di president wey bi head of stet an govmet. Di president wey dem elect dairet an sarf a four-year term wey expired for di nex general shon eleshon; a president fit sarf a maximum of two term. Wen nobodi dey as president Di vice president fit Stan as president.",
