        "Wigwe stat wok for Coopers & Lybrand an Guaranty Trust Bank bifor e join Access Bank in 2002 as di deputy Managin dairekto. E kon bi chief exekutiv ofisa of di kompini in January 2014. E kpai insaid helicopter wey skata on 9 February 2024 insaid United States wen e dey go ci Sunday's Super Bowl LVIII championship in Las Vegas.",
        "E stat im muzik wok in 2006 wen e dey 18 years old wen e dey sel kloth. E dey uze moni wey e xi for di biznes du song an na im e uze du im first rekod \"Toka Mwanzo\", na Bongo flava song wey dem mix wit R&B. Di song no sel wel for market.Plenti pipu sabi am wit \"Kamwanbie\" wey e du for 2010. Di song win 3 awod for Tanzania Muzik Awods. E kon rilis im fest album Kamwanbie dat sem year insaid 2010.Insaid 2014, Platinum Diamond nem dey insaid pesin wey fit win BET Awods 2014 for Bes Intanashona Akt: Africa.Insaid 2023, Diamond Platnumz rilis im sekond song wey e du wit Congolese aktist, Koffi Olomide, wey bi di sekond taim dem go sing togeda.",
        "Crossroads EP ( With Masterkraft ) (2020)",
        "Atunyota Alleluya Akpobome, wey plenti pipu sabi as Ali Baba, na Naija komedian, masta of cerimonis an aktor.",
        "I'll Take My Chances (2011) as Chief Ekpene",
        "Afta di 2015 FIFA katakata wey hapun wey mek dem komot Blatter, Hayatou tek charj of FIFA as aktin president til 26 February 2016, wen Gianni Infantino 2016 FIFA Congress du eleshon to di posishon.",
        "ꠗꠣꠞꠣ ꠪ ꠢꠇꠟ ꠝꠣꠘꠥꠡ ꠡꠣꠗꠤꠘꠜꠣꠛꠦ ꠢꠝꠣꠘ ꠁꠎ꠆ꠎꠔ ꠀꠞ ꠅꠗꠤꠇꠣꠞ ꠟꠁꠀ ꠙꠄꠖꠣ ꠅꠄ ⁕ ꠔꠣꠁꠘꠔꠣꠘ ꠛꠤꠛꠦꠇ ꠀꠞ ꠀꠇꠟ ꠀꠍꠦ ⁕ ꠄꠞ ꠟꠣꠉꠤ ꠢꠇꠟꠞ ꠄꠇꠎꠘꠦ ꠀꠞꠇꠎꠘꠞ ꠟꠉꠦ ꠛꠤꠞꠣꠖꠞꠤꠞ ꠝꠘ ꠟꠁꠀ ꠀꠌꠞꠘ ꠇꠞꠣ ꠃꠌꠤꠔ ⁕",
        "Bianca papa nem na Christian Onoh an e mama nem na Carol Onoh. Christian Onoh bi di forma govanor of Anambra Stet. Bianca mama, Carol Onoh don wok as kolej prisipa bifor. Na six pikin e peret bon: Lilian, Josephine, Nuzo Gabriel, Stella, Christian, Joseph, an Bianca imsef. Na Bianca bi di las bon of di famili.",
        "E enta Nigeria Defens Akademi in 1987 as memba of di 39th Regular kors. Dem kommision am as sekond Liuterant on 19 September 1992 insaid di Naija Infantry Corps. Insaid 1992 an 1995, na Lagbaja bi di platoon kommander of 72 speshial Forces Battalion. In 2001, Lagbaja get Bachelor digre in Geography fom di Nigerian Defence Academy. E stodi strategic Studies for US Army War College for master level.",
        "Keira Hewatch (dem bon am on 8 November 1985) na Naija aktres, singa, songraita an raita, plenti pipu sabi am as Keche insaid Two Brides and a Baby fim, pipu sabi am as Peace Nwosu insaid television series Lekki Wives. Na Hewatch win di Beat of Nollywood award (BON) an ha nem don dey for aktres wey fit win Golden Icon Academy Awards (GIAMA).",
        "Bifor Onyeka start to dey play futbol for FC Ebedei, e dey helep e peret do som ru-fin wok.",
        "Forma Naija presidor Goodluck Jonathan pik Abati as im Spesha Advaisa for niuz mata (mediha) from 2011 go rish 2015.",
        "Nkunku start to dey play for PSG sinior tim on 8 December 2015. Dat day, Nkunku enta for Lucas Moura wen PSG dey play Shaktar Donetsk. Di game finish 2:0 an na Nkunku tim win di game.",
        "Adarabioyo futbol karia start wen e bi five yie old. At di age of five, Adarabioyo sahin for di junior tim of Man City. Na Terry John mek Adarabioyo sahin for man city wen e si am dey one lokal five-aside tornamet.",
        "Jones, D. (1918), \"An Outline of English Phonetics\", Leipzig: Teubner; rpt in Jones (2002).",
        "In 1970, when he visit one old rock church for Tigray wey dem call Abreha and Atsbeha, he see say di ceiling black with smoke. Di priest tell am say na Gudit burn di church, pack hay put inside, then set am on fire — and e happen almost 900 years before.",
        "Ikwerre bụ asụsụ ụda tonal language eji uda asaa: uda elu, ụdaetiti, ụda ala, ụda elu-ala na ada, elu-etiti na uda, etiti-ala na-ada na-ebili. Ikwerre nwekwara tonal downdrift. Dị ka ihe atụ: rínya᷆ (high, mid-low falling) pụtara \"ibu, arọ\", rìnyâ (obere, elu-low falling) pụtara \"nwanyị, nwunye\", mụ̌ (rising) pụtara \"ịmụ\", mụ̂ (high-low falling) pụtara \"ịmụ nwa\", wdg.",
        "Helen even talk say di figures na like her small small people. She dey talk to dem like say dem be real, and she believe say dem dey sing.",
        "Mkpụrụedemede Ayizo dabere na mkpụrụedemede Latịn, yana mgbakwunye nke mkpụrụedemede Ɖ/ɖ, Ɛ/ɛ, and Ɔ/ɔ, na nke digraphs gb, hw, kp, ny, na xw.",
        "Na onli men dey do dis kaind tin nomali, bot Running Eagle agri. Wen shi kom bak, shi tok say shi si vishon of di sun. Di sun tel am say e go giv ha pawa to win batul—if onli shi no slip wit eni man.",
        ". Di word Aje\" get difren minin in yoruba land. Aje fit mins a Afrika wuman wey get di pawa to kill, to helep, to mek someone wey sik dey ok, an to empawa some to faze",
        "Na for Eastern Naija dem bon Akachi Adimora-Ezeigbo and na for dia shi grow. Bot nau shi dey liv for Lagos. Shi bi di fest pikin of Joshua and Christiana Adimora. Shi get five brodas and sistas. Shi grow for vilej side smol, grow for town side tu smol. Na wai wen shi dey rait ha tori-buk, shi dey put vilej and town join for ha tori.",
        "One Nigeria NGO wey dem kol Baobab for Women's Human Rights an som loryas wey sabi both normal lor and Sharia lor hep Amina. One of di loryas, Hauwa Ibrahim, na strong human rights lawyer wey dey hep pipu wey dem wan punish onda Sharia law.",
        "Wen di oyinbo pipo kom start to dey rid an stodi di Greek an Roman kolsho an rilijion, di pipo see sey na Venus de among di god- dem wey popula pass dorin di Greek an Roman empaya time.",
        ".She bi Chair for Ekiti State GBV Management Committee and Ekiti State AIDS Control Agency.",
        "Dis work wey Belpré si for librari mek am dey traful from siti to siti like from Bronx to lowa East Side. As Belpré dey traful, e dey tok tori yuzin English or Spanish Langwej an dis kind tin neva hapun bifor. Dis tin wey Belpré dey do kom mek pipo wey dey spik onli Spanish si sey dia tori too fit enta librari no bi onli English langwej.",
        "Wen pipo dey tok about Mami wota, dem dey tok sey na forin wuman e bi. No Afrika kontri don Eva tok sey Mami wota kom from dia vilej or tribe",
