        "Asase na di wife of Nyankapon . Nyankapon na di god of hevun. Asase stil bi di gel-pikin of Nyame . Nyame bi di wuman part of di three gods Nyankapon-Nyame-Odomakoma. Na dis three gods mek di evri tin wey de dis yunivas. Asase bon two pikin-dem Bea an Tano. Pipo fit stil kol Bea anoda nem wey bi Bia.",
        "Ifeoma Mokwugo Okoye dem bon for 21st December (e fit b 1937), na Nigerian wuman wey sabi rait buk. Pipu wey sabi am dey kol am “di most important wuman raita wey kom fom Nigeria afta Flora Nwapa an Buchi Emecheta,” na wetin Oyekan Owomoyela tok. Shi kom fom Anambra State wey dey Eastern Region of Nigeria. Shi go St. Monica’s College for Ogbunike, an na for dia shi kolet ha tiching certificate for 1959. Leta, shi go University of Nigeria for Nsukka wia shi stodi English an graduate with Bachelor of Arts honors digre for 1977. Shi rait plenti buks, som na for chudren, lik The Village Boy an Eme Goes to School, an shi stil rait adult novel lik Behind the Clouds.",
        "Insaid 2000 an 2001, shi travu go US again, dis taime as Fulbright Scholar for Smith College. Shi tich as guest lecturer for North Carolina Stet University an University of Massachusetts at Amherst. For 2004, shi stat wok as profesor for University of Port Harcourt, an shi tich dia until shi retire for 2017.",
        "Kiki tel Sahara Reporters sey shk don dey receive smol-smol threat sins shi finish di wok.",
        "Wanogho na Naija pikin. Shi go Mayflower School, wia shi do ha primary an sekondri edukeshon. Afta dat one, shi waka go Paris, France, wia shi stodi Interior Design rish di level of M.Sc. For 2008, Wanogho stil go University of Dundee, wia shi get B.A for Painting an shi len how to draw, paint an do art with ha hand. Yoruba kolsho na wetin inspire ha art wok.",
        "Shi go Federal University of Bahia go stodi medicine, an for 1946, shi graduate as doktor.",
        "Dem selekt ha join di 39 raita dem wey neva rich 40 from Afrika an blak pipul wey dey ovasis, for Africa39 projekt - wey be Hay Festival an Rainbow Buk Klob projekt to selebret UNESCO World Book Capital 2014. Dem kari ha tori put for di Africa39 buk. Di tori wey shi rait - This Is How I Remember it - na tori abaut hau one smol gel bigin sabi wetin be lov for Naija. One pesin tok say di tori klia, swit, an na tori wey mek pipul wan rid mo. Anoda pesin tok say di tori strong, as e tok abaut yong lov, lie-lie an strong-wish.",
        "For yia 2000, Yejide komot from Naija go United States bikos shi mari one Amerikana man. Dem two liv for Laurel, Maryland. For 2004, shi muv go Kanada and shi dey liv nau for Chatham-Kent, Ontario.",
        "By di time wey 17th senturi wan rish, pipo no kom dey respet or value di impotats of Nzambici again. Wetin pipo dey tok by dat time bi sey smol smol god-dem like Nzambici gada or surround Nzambi Mpungu. Meni pipo wey sabi holdin days tori hagri sey di wey pipo ridus neshon spirit to smol smol spirit hapun bikos di Portuguese pipo bilif sey na onli one god de an as dem no like emeji or idol hafet di bilif of di lokal pipo. Di koko bi sey bifor bifor Nzambici an Nzambi Mpungu bi god wey pipo dey respet wel wel. Nzampi Mpungu komot from Nzambici an bigin to dey live y imsef an dis one mek pipo dey see am as di pawaful kre-a-tor. Dis tori wan risembu di tori wey kristen pipo sef dey tok about God wey Portuguese pipo kari kom.",
        "Damilola Odufuwa and Odunayo Eweniyi bi di two wumen wey fom di grup for July 2020.",
