        "Di fest raitin rekod wey de about Wanda na wetin polish tori raita Wincenty Kadlubek. Meni pipo wey sabi hodin dayz tori bilif sey na lie Wincenty Kadlubek dek tok for wetin e rait. In Kadlubek tori, e tok sey wen e papa kpai, prinses Wanda bikom king an kontro di pipo of Poland. E tok sey dat time, di pipo of Alamann tyrant dey fight Poland. E tok sey prinses Wanda dey always dey folo join im solja to go fight dem. E tok sey wen di solja of German see sey prinses Wanda fine wel wel, dey no dey fight am again an sey di lida of German solja yuz im hand kpai imsef. Akordin to di tori, Prinses Wanda tok sey mek dem nem one riva Vandalus afta am. Dey kol dey kol pipo wey prinses Wanda dey kontro Vandals. For Kadlubek tori, prinses Wanda no mari an e live long wel wel.",
        "The 5 AM Club: Own Your Morning, Elevate Your Life na self-help book wey Robin Sharma write. Di book na fictional story wey talk about morning routine and how e fit change person life make e better. Di story follow one artist and one entrepreneur wey come connect with one billionaire, and di billionaire come teach dem im secret to success.",
