        "For November 2022, Gummi show say she happy with di court judgement wey concern Aisha Binani. She tok say de court ruling show people for dis kontri say courts for Nigeria dey ready to make sure say justice prevail anytime e necessary. She still tok say de ruling show say women don become more active and get more influence for Nigerian politics. According to am, dis development be sign say more people for Nigeria don dey accept women for politics.",
